(1467991, 190958, 24976, '<td valign="top">on  purely technical aspects its a really good photo (lighting and composition are the two things that stand out most to me)... but in terms of the challenge, fantasy world, i dont really get it. the challenge description reads "Photograph something that you might see in a world beyond our own", i dont really see that here.</td>', 'on  purely technical aspects its a really good photo (lighting and composition are the two things that stand out most to me)... but in terms of the challenge, fantasy world, i dont really get it. the challenge description reads "Photograph something that you might see in a world beyond our own", i dont really see that here.', '2005-06-20 01:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
