(1468116, 192481, 24976, '<td valign="top">the mercurial border is unnecessary and an unneeded distraction imo. i like the image though, just really really wish the border wasnt there.</td>', 'the mercurial border is unnecessary and an unneeded distraction imo. i like the image though, just really really wish the border wasnt there.', '2005-06-20 02:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468117, 191033, 31036, '<td valign="top">WOW</td>', 'WOW', '2005-06-20 02:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468119, 192420, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific image. I love the way you blurred the inside of the hollow part. I hope your photographer''s comments will tell us how you did it. Good luck in the voting.</td>', 'This is a terrific image. I love the way you blurred the inside of the hollow part. I hope your photographer''s comments will tell us how you did it. Good luck in the voting.', '2005-06-20 02:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468122, 190957, 24976, '<td valign="top">would i have been posible for you get closer to the vally and recompose in order to cut the foreground so you almost have the wind turbines floating in space? that would make a really cool photo imo.</td>', 'would i have been posible for you get closer to the vally and recompose in order to cut the foreground so you almost have the wind turbines floating in space? that would make a really cool photo imo.', '2005-06-20 02:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468123, 192406, 24976, '<td valign="top">one of my top picks. well taken.</td>', 'one of my top picks. well taken.', '2005-06-20 02:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468126, 192227, 37544, '<td valign="top">PERFECT choice, I hate the sky though</td>', 'PERFECT choice, I hate the sky though', '2005-06-20 02:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468127, 190957, 18197, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of this shot. The foggy ridge with wind generators is other worldly. The trees in the middle ground against the fog are great. I gave it a good score but would have given it a couple of more points if you had straightened the horizon and eliminated most of the foreground hill. I doubt this would have been easy in post processing but if you had shot a few other angles and positions, it might have been possible. Great photo. I hope it does well in the voting.</td>', 'I really like the idea of this shot. The foggy ridge with wind generators is other worldly. The trees in the middle ground against the fog are great. I gave it a good score but would have given it a couple of more points if you had straightened the horizon and eliminated most of the foreground hill. I doubt this would have been easy in post processing but if you had shot a few other angles and positions, it might have been possible. Great photo. I hope it does well in the voting.', '2005-06-20 02:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468128, 191162, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice tie in to the fantasy theme, one of only a few that did a good job with that aspect. Composition is interesting. DOF must have been a bit of a challenge. My only nit pick (and it''s small) is that the subject wizard (?) feels flat compared to the foreground. Not sure what could be done about it, but if it had greater depth, I could have given it a point or 2 more. Good luck in the voting.</td>', 'Nice tie in to the fantasy theme, one of only a few that did a good job with that aspect. Composition is interesting. DOF must have been a bit of a challenge. My only nit pick (and it''s small) is that the subject wizard (?) feels flat compared to the foreground. Not sure what could be done about it, but if it had greater depth, I could have given it a point or 2 more. Good luck in the voting.', '2005-06-20 02:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468131, 191162, 37544, '<td valign="top">that is one amazing look a like!!</td>', 'that is one amazing look a like!!', '2005-06-20 02:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468133, 192361, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. You''ve done a nice job turning a plain ridgeline into an other worldly feeling landscape. There are a few artifacts along the ridgeline (far left and far right)  that are indicative of selective levels work. I am really struggling to get rid of these in my photos which is probably why I noticed it. Not a major distraction.</td>', 'I like this a lot. You''ve done a nice job turning a plain ridgeline into an other worldly feeling landscape. There are a few artifacts along the ridgeline (far left and far right)  that are indicative of selective levels work. I am really struggling to get rid of these in my photos which is probably why I noticed it. Not a major distraction.', '2005-06-20 02:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468135, 191414, 24976, '<td valign="top">if i had to guess i would say this is in iceland...<br/> <br/>The photo is  so beautiful and so magical with the low clouds. a 10 from me.</td>', 'if i had to guess i would say this is in iceland... The photo is  so beautiful and so magical with the low clouds. a 10 from me.', '2005-06-20 02:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468138, 189512, 24976, '<td valign="top">excellent for the challenge. 9</td>', 'excellent for the challenge. 9', '2005-06-20 02:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468139, 192461, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo. The colors and composition are terrific. The pods are a nice counterpoint to the full blooms. With all the smoke (?) I hope no flowers were injured or killed in the attempt (lol). I am struggling a bit to find the tie in to the theme but you''re in good company since 80% of the photos struggled with this as well. So i don''t think that will hurt your scores. Good luck inthe voting.</td>', 'This is a very nice photo. The colors and composition are terrific. The pods are a nice counterpoint to the full blooms. With all the smoke (?) I hope no flowers were injured or killed in the attempt (lol). I am struggling a bit to find the tie in to the theme but you''re in good company since 80% of the photos struggled with this as well. So i don''t think that will hurt your scores. Good luck inthe voting.', '2005-06-20 02:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468149, 191527, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. THis challenge was hard - I gave up.</td>', 'Very cool idea. THis challenge was hard - I gave up.', '2005-06-20 02:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468150, 190850, 18197, '<td valign="top">Feels like something Lewis Carol or C.S.Lewis might have written about. Nice job. You did a nice job masking off the trees to colorize them. I like the subdued background but that will probably be a matter of personal taste for folks. It feels a little oversharpened but that actually contributes to the fantasy. Good luck in the voting.</td>', 'Feels like something Lewis Carol or C.S.Lewis might have written about. Nice job. You did a nice job masking off the trees to colorize them. I like the subdued background but that will probably be a matter of personal taste for folks. It feels a little oversharpened but that actually contributes to the fantasy. Good luck in the voting.', '2005-06-20 02:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468151, 189944, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great abstract image. It''s interesting, the thumbnail gives an entirely different impression from the full sized image. Reflections are very good. I hope you''ll tell us where theis was taken and how you did it.</td>', 'Great abstract image. It''s interesting, the thumbnail gives an entirely different impression from the full sized image. Reflections are very good. I hope you''ll tell us where theis was taken and how you did it.', '2005-06-20 02:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
