(1468429, 192472, 9089, '<td valign="top">This is a photo I really wanted to like a lot.  The composition, and subjects look fascinating.  However the depth of field/focus just makes me not want to look at it.  I think a larger DOF would help it tremendously.  Also, be careful with the unsharp mask as it is causing a little haloing on your photo.  If it happens, you can always smudge it back carefully.</td>', 'This is a photo I really wanted to like a lot.  The composition, and subjects look fascinating.  However the depth of field/focus just makes me not want to look at it.  I think a larger DOF would help it tremendously.  Also, be careful with the unsharp mask as it is causing a little haloing on your photo.  If it happens, you can always smudge it back carefully.', '2005-06-20 05:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1468430, 191234, 9089, '<td valign="top">I like this.  However, wish the car was more to the right to be on the right third instead of dead center.  5</td>', 'I like this.  However, wish the car was more to the right to be on the right third instead of dead center.  5', '2005-06-20 05:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
