(1469067, 191541, 6519, '<td valign="top">Curiously out of focus, yet it doesn''t matter - that''s just how this looks. I''d almost prefer a more neutral title, since I didn''t think "jellyfish" when I saw this. Lovely abstract, great for the challenge, nice colours........ love it!</td>', 'Curiously out of focus, yet it doesn''t matter - that''s just how this looks. I''d almost prefer a more neutral title, since I didn''t think "jellyfish" when I saw this. Lovely abstract, great for the challenge, nice colours........ love it!', '2005-06-20 12:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
