(1469108, 192423, 20679, '<td valign="top">Very cute take on this challenge, Technically it is rather weak but it has a lot of potential. Hard to light the eye and the doll house evenly. Perhaps a long exposure on a tripod rather than the flash?</td>', 'Very cute take on this challenge, Technically it is rather weak but it has a lot of potential. Hard to light the eye and the doll house evenly. Perhaps a long exposure on a tripod rather than the flash?', '2005-06-20 13:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469111, 192485, 19746, '<td valign="top">I like this stark landscape, dramatic and other wordly it most certainly is.  I think you''ll get a lot of people claming that this did not meet the challenge, but I figure any strange, dramatic landscape fits.<br/> <br/>Perhaps try pushing up the contrast with this, or desaturating using the channel mixer instead of the ''normal way''.  <br/> <br/>As it is the shot is a little unstriking and bland (but not too much) - a 7 from me.<br/>Alex<br/> <br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'I like this stark landscape, dramatic and other wordly it most certainly is.  I think you''ll get a lot of people claming that this did not meet the challenge, but I figure any strange, dramatic landscape fits. Perhaps try pushing up the contrast with this, or desaturating using the channel mixer instead of the ''normal way''.   As it is the shot is a little unstriking and bland (but not too much) - a 7 from me.Alex  Alex', '2005-06-20 13:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
