(1469117, 191197, 2764, '<td valign="top">Ill race you to the brown - im headed that way anyways - this is even borderline on the rules which say your picture can''t be of another work of art - putting the halo behind his head doesnt make it much more interesting but it does make it your own creation.</td>', 'Ill race you to the brown - im headed that way anyways - this is even borderline on the rules which say your picture can''t be of another work of art - putting the halo behind his head doesnt make it much more interesting but it does make it your own creation.', '2005-06-20 13:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469119, 191564, 20679, '<td valign="top">Yes! I like this a lot. Super macro and an excellent comp. The back lighting has enhanced the silhouette and the contrast is first class. A great take on the challenge that deserved to be looked at for a long time. Trouble is, a lot of people flick through so fast that it may be missed by some voters. I hope not as it deserved to be in the top ten at least (together with mine of course ;)</td>', 'Yes! I like this a lot. Super macro and an excellent comp. The back lighting has enhanced the silhouette and the contrast is first class. A great take on the challenge that deserved to be looked at for a long time. Trouble is, a lot of people flick through so fast that it may be missed by some voters. I hope not as it deserved to be in the top ten at least (together with mine of course ;)', '2005-06-20 13:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469121, 190850, 32792, '<td valign="top">Idea is good, but it looks overprocessed. More of digital art!<br/>Focus is good, and the trees look very sharp! Maybe less colors, what you say?!?</td>', 'Idea is good, but it looks overprocessed. More of digital art!Focus is good, and the trees look very sharp! Maybe less colors, what you say?!?', '2005-06-20 13:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
