(1469645, 190734, 37719, '<td valign="top">Have to admit I laughed pretty hard on first look.  So hard that my secretary came in the office and asked me if I was ok.  I like it.  Nice job.</td>', 'Have to admit I laughed pretty hard on first look.  So hard that my secretary came in the office and asked me if I was ok.  I like it.  Nice job.', '2005-06-20 18:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
