(1469690, 191370, 255, '<td valign="top">this is awesome--love the crisp focus on the  bubbles and the graduated colors. very cool.</td>', 'this is awesome--love the crisp focus on the  bubbles and the graduated colors. very cool.', '2005-06-20 19:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469693, 191234, 33947, '<td valign="top">Creative take on the challenge. I love the old partrol car, but I especially like the sky and the way you colorized it. Neat job.</td>', 'Creative take on the challenge. I love the old partrol car, but I especially like the sky and the way you colorized it. Neat job.', '2005-06-20 19:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469705, 192447, 255, '<td valign="top">too cute--she reminds me of sylvie from lewis carroll''s sylvie and bruno. the treatment works well with this shot. nicely done.</td>', 'too cute--she reminds me of sylvie from lewis carroll''s sylvie and bruno. the treatment works well with this shot. nicely done.', '2005-06-20 19:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469706, 192303, 18197, '<td valign="top">Your photo appears to have an artifact of post processing along the horizon which is pretty distracting. I have had the same problem when I divide the photo into parts and try post processing each part differently. Sometimes I can copy a part ot a layer, post process it there, fade it a bit and leave the background image on the bottom layer to correct this. Layer stacking order is also important.</td>', 'Your photo appears to have an artifact of post processing along the horizon which is pretty distracting. I have had the same problem when I divide the photo into parts and try post processing each part differently. Sometimes I can copy a part ot a layer, post process it there, fade it a bit and leave the background image on the bottom layer to correct this. Layer stacking order is also important.', '2005-06-20 19:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469710, 192487, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo but I''m unsure of the relevance to the theme.</td>', 'Interesting photo but I''m unsure of the relevance to the theme.', '2005-06-20 19:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469711, 192303, 33947, '<td valign="top">High points for trying something different. Love the sky and the flowers. My only suggestion for improvement would be to make the horses more visable since your title focuses on the "ride."</td>', 'High points for trying something different. Love the sky and the flowers. My only suggestion for improvement would be to make the horses more visable since your title focuses on the "ride."', '2005-06-20 19:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469714, 191527, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo idea. I would like it better with sharper focus, especially around the lens itself. Not sure it''s all that relevant to the theme.</td>', 'Interesting photo idea. I would like it better with sharper focus, especially around the lens itself. Not sure it''s all that relevant to the theme.', '2005-06-20 19:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469716, 191495, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice red shift.</td>', 'Nice red shift.', '2005-06-20 19:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469720, 192143, 255, '<td valign="top">i love this. very simple and perfectly surreal-and it''s very cool the way it fades to white. great shot.</td>', 'i love this. very simple and perfectly surreal-and it''s very cool the way it fades to white. great shot.', '2005-06-20 19:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469721, 192352, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not sure about relevance to the theme?</td>', 'Not sure about relevance to the theme?', '2005-06-20 19:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469747, 191448, 255, '<td valign="top">this grabbed my attention just from the thumb--gorgeous colors and light patterns (kinda reminds me of dax''s stuff)...really makes this shot. nicely done.</td>', 'this grabbed my attention just from the thumb--gorgeous colors and light patterns (kinda reminds me of dax''s stuff)...really makes this shot. nicely done.', '2005-06-20 19:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
