(1469753, 192457, 368, '<td valign="top">quite an interesting image ... i would have liked to see a face of some sort though ... and maybe the background colored and the being in the foil</td>', 'quite an interesting image ... i would have liked to see a face of some sort though ... and maybe the background colored and the being in the foil', '2005-06-20 19:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469759, 190658, 368, '<td valign="top">i''m not quite sure the invert works well here ... or maybe the refelction should have more detail in it ... i like the idea ... but maybe some tweaking may help it</td>', 'i''m not quite sure the invert works well here ... or maybe the refelction should have more detail in it ... i like the idea ... but maybe some tweaking may help it', '2005-06-20 19:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469767, 190991, 368, '<td valign="top">i like the idea .. but i think the image may have worked better if you did a more artistic filter than a motion blur concept ... but that''s just me :)</td>', 'i like the idea .. but i think the image may have worked better if you did a more artistic filter than a motion blur concept ... but that''s just me :)', '2005-06-20 19:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469768, 191327, 255, '<td valign="top">this is really neat--i like the colors and the treatment...it fits the challenge well.</td>', 'this is really neat--i like the colors and the treatment...it fits the challenge well.', '2005-06-20 19:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469772, 191559, 33947, '<td valign="top">Creative way to meet the challenge. Like your idea very much. Not so sure about the execution, though. I Like the line of the body, and the light and shadows on it. But, the soul departing doens''t quite do it.  It looks like somebody sitting on the edge of the bed. Regardless, I''m impressed with what you tried here. 7</td>', 'Creative way to meet the challenge. Like your idea very much. Not so sure about the execution, though. I Like the line of the body, and the light and shadows on it. But, the soul departing doens''t quite do it.  It looks like somebody sitting on the edge of the bed. Regardless, I''m impressed with what you tried here. 7', '2005-06-20 19:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469786, 190958, 33947, '<td valign="top">Great way to meet the challenge. Love the sharpness and detail. For my tasted, wish there was a bit more light. Like the line the body takes.</td>', 'Great way to meet the challenge. Love the sharpness and detail. For my tasted, wish there was a bit more light. Like the line the body takes.', '2005-06-20 19:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469789, 192361, 255, '<td valign="top">this is cool--i like the plain, stark colors...fits my notion of the bleak planet nicely. well done.</td>', 'this is cool--i like the plain, stark colors...fits my notion of the bleak planet nicely. well done.', '2005-06-20 19:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
