(1469818, 191307, 33947, '<td valign="top">Creative. I like the bottom 2/3''s of the egg, but the top part is kind of garbled and hard to make out. Major points for trying !</td>', 'Creative. I like the bottom 2/3''s of the egg, but the top part is kind of garbled and hard to make out. Major points for trying !', '2005-06-20 19:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
