(1469837, 191570, 33947, '<td valign="top">The top part of Bot looks fantastic. Lighting is terrific, and the surface is, too. The bottom part is less interesting and a little hard to make out. That said, fun way to meet the challenge. I like it.</td>', 'The top part of Bot looks fantastic. Lighting is terrific, and the surface is, too. The bottom part is less interesting and a little hard to make out. That said, fun way to meet the challenge. I like it.', '2005-06-20 19:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
