(1469846, 191543, 33947, '<td valign="top">Sharp as a pin and excellently lit. As a composition, though, there''s a lot going on, and there''s no pleasing line or form that''s really catching my eye.</td>', 'Sharp as a pin and excellently lit. As a composition, though, there''s a lot going on, and there''s no pleasing line or form that''s really catching my eye.', '2005-06-20 19:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469848, 192385, 33947, '<td valign="top">Good capture for land of the fairies. You just know they have to live in there. The softness works in this photo.</td>', 'Good capture for land of the fairies. You just know they have to live in there. The softness works in this photo.', '2005-06-20 20:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469853, 191369, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like the hair and the green background. Neat effects. The body, though, strikes me as Barbie, and is not as interesting. Points for trying something different, though.</td>', 'I like the hair and the green background. Neat effects. The body, though, strikes me as Barbie, and is not as interesting. Points for trying something different, though.', '2005-06-20 20:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469856, 191383, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, but, it''s kind of hard to make out what''s going on. Still, points for trying!</td>', 'I like your idea, but, it''s kind of hard to make out what''s going on. Still, points for trying!', '2005-06-20 20:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469866, 192460, 19746, '<td valign="top">Well that''s pretty awesome.  Well composed to emphasize the height of the jump (and that is a pretty big jump!). <br/> <br/> I''m glad to see you didn''t succumb to the tempation to burn those clouds to pieces in PS.   Are those bubbles I see? Great shot, great pose from the model - I get fantasy world from this and I hope everyone else does as well!<br/> <br/>Good luck<br/> <br/>Alex (9)</td>', 'Well that''s pretty awesome.  Well composed to emphasize the height of the jump (and that is a pretty big jump!).   I''m glad to see you didn''t succumb to the tempation to burn those clouds to pieces in PS.   Are those bubbles I see? Great shot, great pose from the model - I get fantasy world from this and I hope everyone else does as well! Good luck Alex (9)', '2005-06-20 20:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469867, 192444, 259, '<td valign="top">i like the mood</td>', 'i like the mood', '2005-06-20 20:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469869, 190532, 33947, '<td valign="top">Creative effort. Major points for attempting it. It is, however, a little cluttered and busy for me. Not sure I can make it all out. Do like the effects you achieved on the fish and the seaweed. Fun photo.</td>', 'Creative effort. Major points for attempting it. It is, however, a little cluttered and busy for me. Not sure I can make it all out. Do like the effects you achieved on the fish and the seaweed. Fun photo.', '2005-06-20 20:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469872, 191454, 33947, '<td valign="top">Fun way to meet the challenge. Love the head and front leg for detail and clarity. The back is a blurry.</td>', 'Fun way to meet the challenge. Love the head and front leg for detail and clarity. The back is a blurry.', '2005-06-20 20:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469876, 192337, 33947, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. Well done.</td>', 'Interesting effect. Well done.', '2005-06-20 20:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469877, 192480, 19746, '<td valign="top">Great Bokeh and DOF.  I like the tones as well.  I don''t know what I think about taking a photo of a figurine, but you''ve done this really brilliantly. <br/> <br/>You''ve managed to create a fantasy world that looks extremely real using a very fake looking prop, which is obviously quite difficult.  Good job on this one...<br/> <br/>8<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Great Bokeh and DOF.  I like the tones as well.  I don''t know what I think about taking a photo of a figurine, but you''ve done this really brilliantly.  You''ve managed to create a fantasy world that looks extremely real using a very fake looking prop, which is obviously quite difficult.  Good job on this one... 8 Alex', '2005-06-20 20:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469879, 191448, 33947, '<td valign="top">Creative. Interestingly lit. Like it.</td>', 'Creative. Interestingly lit. Like it.', '2005-06-20 20:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469884, 191541, 33947, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Fun. Wish it wasn''t quite so soft.</td>', 'Great idea. Fun. Wish it wasn''t quite so soft.', '2005-06-20 20:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469885, 192166, 33947, '<td valign="top">Fun concept. Not sure it plays real well as a composition. Points for trying!!</td>', 'Fun concept. Not sure it plays real well as a composition. Points for trying!!', '2005-06-20 20:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
