(1469933, 191370, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love it! Nice color and brightness. VERY SHARP. Nice way to meet the challenge. Good luck! ...Second look, bumping. 9</td>', 'Love it! Nice color and brightness. VERY SHARP. Nice way to meet the challenge. Good luck! ...Second look, bumping. 9', '2005-06-20 20:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
