(1469941, 191282, 33947, '<td valign="top">Appealing line, and nice, background that doesn''t compete. I found it more appealing before it clicked as to what the black surface was. The mysteriousness was neat. Even so, this is a cool photo. I hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Appealing line, and nice, background that doesn''t compete. I found it more appealing before it clicked as to what the black surface was. The mysteriousness was neat. Even so, this is a cool photo. I hope it does well for you.', '2005-06-20 20:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
