(1469945, 190482, 31036, '<td valign="top">Im sure this is the twisted barrel method... im still amazed nearly every time I see it.<br/>The only thing I would change is the sign in the upper right (not having it there). Good job!</td>', 'Im sure this is the twisted barrel method... im still amazed nearly every time I see it.The only thing I would change is the sign in the upper right (not having it there). Good job!', '2005-06-20 20:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
