(1470299, 189944, 13688, '<td valign="top">there''s definitely a bunch going on here.  i find it most interesting not being able to figure out what part of the plane you pointed the camera at.  my eye is drawn immediately to the blue sky, but then is stopped by the brown reflection above it.  i''m just not feeling alot of flow in this pic to make it work for me.</td>', 'there''s definitely a bunch going on here.  i find it most interesting not being able to figure out what part of the plane you pointed the camera at.  my eye is drawn immediately to the blue sky, but then is stopped by the brown reflection above it.  i''m just not feeling alot of flow in this pic to make it work for me.', '2005-06-20 23:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470304, 192213, 13688, '<td valign="top">you had a very mysterious subject..."close encounters" like.  wish you had taken a chance and given it an equally mysterious title like "0027".  i would have cloned out the distant mountains, maybe tightened the crop just a bit more.  i do like your choice to center it.</td>', 'you had a very mysterious subject..."close encounters" like.  wish you had taken a chance and given it an equally mysterious title like "0027".  i would have cloned out the distant mountains, maybe tightened the crop just a bit more.  i do like your choice to center it.', '2005-06-21 00:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
