(1470317, 191380, 13688, '<td valign="top">clouds really work here, making it look like everything''s speeding at the viewer.  wish you had come up with a way to get the details out of your forest, as it really brings me back to reality.  i think a complete silhouette would have really worked well for this particular challenge topic.</td>', 'clouds really work here, making it look like everything''s speeding at the viewer.  wish you had come up with a way to get the details out of your forest, as it really brings me back to reality.  i think a complete silhouette would have really worked well for this particular challenge topic.', '2005-06-21 00:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
