(1470356, 192460, 38706, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!  I love the sureal feeling and the floating affect.</td>', 'Great shot!!  I love the sureal feeling and the floating affect.', '2005-06-21 00:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470368, 192381, 13688, '<td valign="top">extremely thought provoking.  Even with your title, which is still very ambiguous, i''m not sure if you were going for the fact that some people are living in a fantasy world of fear...or not meeting the challenge and showing what should be fantasy is indeed reality. I''d like to think the latter.  nice work. processing seems a bit harsh, and focus seems a bit soft, but could work to fit the theme, especially the way the eyes have turned out-9</td>', 'extremely thought provoking.  Even with your title, which is still very ambiguous, i''m not sure if you were going for the fact that some people are living in a fantasy world of fear...or not meeting the challenge and showing what should be fantasy is indeed reality. I''d like to think the latter.  nice work. processing seems a bit harsh, and focus seems a bit soft, but could work to fit the theme, especially the way the eyes have turned out-9', '2005-06-21 01:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470370, 191059, 3080, '<td valign="top">I don''t prefer the effect here.  This appears way to busy for everything to fall into place together.  The clashing patterns of her blouse and skirt against that busy background hurt my eyes.  The little thing hiding behind her hand is interesting, but we can''t really see it.  Looks like maybe a stuffed bird?</td>', 'I don''t prefer the effect here.  This appears way to busy for everything to fall into place together.  The clashing patterns of her blouse and skirt against that busy background hurt my eyes.  The little thing hiding behind her hand is interesting, but we can''t really see it.  Looks like maybe a stuffed bird?', '2005-06-21 01:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470377, 192337, 6519, '<td valign="top">Good idea and execution. The title goes a long way in explaining your thinking behind this shot, but isn''t totally necessary for the photo.</td>', 'Good idea and execution. The title goes a long way in explaining your thinking behind this shot, but isn''t totally necessary for the photo.', '2005-06-21 01:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
