(1470402, 192205, 6519, '<td valign="top">This would do MUCH better if her head was completely under water and she appeared as if she didn''t need to breathe. As it is, this is just an earth woman in a whacky swim suit. Nice change, though, to have an underwater pic!!!</td>', 'This would do MUCH better if her head was completely under water and she appeared as if she didn''t need to breathe. As it is, this is just an earth woman in a whacky swim suit. Nice change, though, to have an underwater pic!!!', '2005-06-21 01:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
