(1470411, 192194, 6519, '<td valign="top">I have NO idea what I am looking at, but in this challenge, that is not necessarily a bad thing. I love the dramatic angle, the isolation, and even the b&amp;w in this case. There is some rather distracting banding (processing problem???) happening in the sky.</td>', 'I have NO idea what I am looking at, but in this challenge, that is not necessarily a bad thing. I love the dramatic angle, the isolation, and even the b&w in this case. There is some rather distracting banding (processing problem???) happening in the sky.', '2005-06-21 01:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470412, 192444, 6519, '<td valign="top">"A world beyond our own" ???? Looks very earthlike to me.</td>', '"A world beyond our own" ???? Looks very earthlike to me.', '2005-06-21 01:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470415, 190722, 6519, '<td valign="top">Aaawwwww she is precious, and the exaggerated processing is perfect for this shot.</td>', 'Aaawwwww she is precious, and the exaggerated processing is perfect for this shot.', '2005-06-21 01:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470418, 192451, 6519, '<td valign="top">Pretty little waterfall, but very much on earth. This doesn''t say "a world beyond our own" to me, sorry.</td>', 'Pretty little waterfall, but very much on earth. This doesn''t say "a world beyond our own" to me, sorry.', '2005-06-21 01:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470421, 190883, 6519, '<td valign="top">The exaggerated colour treatment makes this a little bit more than just another very earthly waterfall. Getting there.......</td>', 'The exaggerated colour treatment makes this a little bit more than just another very earthly waterfall. Getting there.......', '2005-06-21 01:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470422, 191414, 6519, '<td valign="top">I looks remote and fog/mist is always nicely mysterious, but other than that it is just a road in our world, with a centered composition.  Nothing amazing about it, sorry.</td>', 'I looks remote and fog/mist is always nicely mysterious, but other than that it is just a road in our world, with a centered composition.  Nothing amazing about it, sorry.', '2005-06-21 01:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470423, 192343, 6519, '<td valign="top">The sidelighting gives this.... ummm....... thing.... nice dimension. It would be good if the support stucture under the belly wasn''t so visible, and it would be even better if you had had the chance to make the floor look "natural" somehow.<br/>Well spotted monster!</td>', 'The sidelighting gives this.... ummm....... thing.... nice dimension. It would be good if the support stucture under the belly wasn''t so visible, and it would be even better if you had had the chance to make the floor look "natural" somehow.Well spotted monster!', '2005-06-21 01:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470424, 190850, 38793, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, and I love this fantasy!   I hope you win.</td>', 'I love this photo, and I love this fantasy!   I hope you win.', '2005-06-21 01:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470425, 192460, 38793, '<td valign="top">Love it!!!</td>', 'Love it!!!', '2005-06-21 01:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470426, 191162, 6519, '<td valign="top">This looks fairly believable and certainly weird enough to fit the challenge. Nice composition.</td>', 'This looks fairly believable and certainly weird enough to fit the challenge. Nice composition.', '2005-06-21 01:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470429, 192385, 6519, '<td valign="top">The oversaturation, soft focus and glow effect work very well in this challenge and this photo.  I''m almost ready to believe that this is a scene from a "world beyond our own". <br/>My eyes keep searching for a subject, though.</td>', 'The oversaturation, soft focus and glow effect work very well in this challenge and this photo.  I''m almost ready to believe that this is a scene from a "world beyond our own". My eyes keep searching for a subject, though.', '2005-06-21 01:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470431, 191564, 6519, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, angle, POV, and DOF. It all looks bizarre enough to be from another world.</td>', 'Great lighting, angle, POV, and DOF. It all looks bizarre enough to be from another world.', '2005-06-21 01:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470432, 192481, 6519, '<td valign="top">It''s a sunset. You tweaked the colours a bit, but it''s still a very earthly sunset. I HATE the border. You did a great job with the exposure.</td>', 'It''s a sunset. You tweaked the colours a bit, but it''s still a very earthly sunset. I HATE the border. You did a great job with the exposure.', '2005-06-21 01:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470433, 191527, 38706, '<td valign="top">Great us of the sky reflection.</td>', 'Great us of the sky reflection.', '2005-06-21 01:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470434, 192365, 6519, '<td valign="top">Her wonderful expression makes me almost believe that dragon came to life in front of her eyes. Nice idea and different take on the challenge!</td>', 'Her wonderful expression makes me almost believe that dragon came to life in front of her eyes. Nice idea and different take on the challenge!', '2005-06-21 01:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470438, 190850, 6519, '<td valign="top">No idea how this is done "legally", but  it looks great!</td>', 'No idea how this is done "legally", but  it looks great!', '2005-06-21 01:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470442, 191303, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like the way you lit that critter - gives a good sense of depth and dimension.</td>', 'I like the way you lit that critter - gives a good sense of depth and dimension.', '2005-06-21 01:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470503, 192053, 39549, '<td valign="top">What''s the exposure length on this? It''s perfect for this category. A little longer would''ve been too whited out, a hair less would''ve looked good but not quite as dreamy.</td>', 'What''s the exposure length on this? It''s perfect for this category. A little longer would''ve been too whited out, a hair less would''ve looked good but not quite as dreamy.', '2005-06-21 03:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470504, 191415, 31443, '<td valign="top">Dainty and nicely set up, I like it!</td>', 'Dainty and nicely set up, I like it!', '2005-06-21 03:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470511, 190603, 31443, '<td valign="top">Ahhh fantasy, good one!</td>', 'Ahhh fantasy, good one!', '2005-06-21 03:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470518, 192265, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective on this photo!  It does a really great job of making me feel like I''m an inch and a half tall....very well done.  Lighting is good and provides interesting colors.  Good clarity and detail.</td>', 'I love the perspective on this photo!  It does a really great job of making me feel like I''m an inch and a half tall....very well done.  Lighting is good and provides interesting colors.  Good clarity and detail.', '2005-06-21 03:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470520, 192205, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love underwater shots!  This is truly beautiful.  The only thing that would make it better would be if I could see the face, perhaps a sly smile.  Otherwise, just gorgeous!</td>', 'I love underwater shots!  This is truly beautiful.  The only thing that would make it better would be if I could see the face, perhaps a sly smile.  Otherwise, just gorgeous!', '2005-06-21 03:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470521, 192157, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective of this shot.  The colors are stunning and the architecture is beautiful.  It truly transports me to another world.</td>', 'I love the perspective of this shot.  The colors are stunning and the architecture is beautiful.  It truly transports me to another world.', '2005-06-21 03:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470522, 192447, 35513, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite shots in this challenge :-)  I really really like it.  Absolutely adorable model, great costuming.  I really like the sepia tones as well.  Very fantasy feel to this shot.</td>', 'One of my favorite shots in this challenge :-)  I really really like it.  Absolutely adorable model, great costuming.  I really like the sepia tones as well.  Very fantasy feel to this shot.', '2005-06-21 03:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470523, 192469, 31443, '<td valign="top">Like your title..</td>', 'Like your title..', '2005-06-21 03:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470524, 191448, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this photo....it just really strikes me.  Simple subject, but it most definitely works.  Very well done!</td>', 'I love the colors in this photo....it just really strikes me.  Simple subject, but it most definitely works.  Very well done!', '2005-06-21 03:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470525, 191234, 35513, '<td valign="top">This photo really grabbed my attention.  A classic shot with an otherwordly kind of feel to it.  Really like the sepia tones.  Very well done!</td>', 'This photo really grabbed my attention.  A classic shot with an otherwordly kind of feel to it.  Really like the sepia tones.  Very well done!', '2005-06-21 03:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470526, 192339, 35513, '<td valign="top">Just eerie!  Definitely has a fantasy world feel to it.  I like the choice of colors quite a bit.  Well done!</td>', 'Just eerie!  Definitely has a fantasy world feel to it.  I like the choice of colors quite a bit.  Well done!', '2005-06-21 03:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470527, 191296, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!  The colors and lighting are stunning.  And I love the image on the one small child in this big world....definitely fits the challenge.  Very well done!</td>', 'I love this photo!  The colors and lighting are stunning.  And I love the image on the one small child in this big world....definitely fits the challenge.  Very well done!', '2005-06-21 03:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
