(1476445, 190850, 19746, '<td valign="top">Whoah...<br/> <br/>Far out ;) <br/> <br/>A 7 from me, simple composition, busy and rhythmic but it works out nicely and the colours are fantastic and really ''far out''.  I think you''ve leaned to heavily on the PS work here though.  Nevertheless, I really like this image!  A 7 from me :)<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Whoah... Far out ;)  A 7 from me, simple composition, busy and rhythmic but it works out nicely and the colours are fantastic and really ''far out''.  I think you''ve leaned to heavily on the PS work here though.  Nevertheless, I really like this image!  A 7 from me :) Alex', '2005-06-22 19:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476488, 192053, 19746, '<td valign="top">A great image, although I think the execution could be a touch better :( <br/> <br/>The whites are too hot, increasing the f-stop so that you can expose it for long to get ''soft water'' without over exposing the image :)<br/> <br/>6 from me and good luck!<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'A great image, although I think the execution could be a touch better :(  The whites are too hot, increasing the f-stop so that you can expose it for long to get ''soft water'' without over exposing the image :) 6 from me and good luck! Alex', '2005-06-22 19:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476523, 190850, 34192, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  Everytime I browse the thumbnails I have to open this one up to look.  Its not the best technically in this challenge and there are other images that make me go wow! But this image has been growing on me and I have no idea why.  I had scored it an 8 but I''m bumping it up to 10.  I can''t relate to you what quality this image has that keeps me coming back but you got me.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Love this shot.  Everytime I browse the thumbnails I have to open this one up to look.  Its not the best technically in this challenge and there are other images that make me go wow! But this image has been growing on me and I have no idea why.  I had scored it an 8 but I''m bumping it up to 10.  I can''t relate to you what quality this image has that keeps me coming back but you got me.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-22 20:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476526, 190482, 368, '<td valign="top">it''s hard to focus on one thing here .... i like the idea - but i think one image at least should have the most focus</td>', 'it''s hard to focus on one thing here .... i like the idea - but i think one image at least should have the most focus', '2005-06-22 20:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476529, 192092, 368, '<td valign="top">i think you would have impast of the image and mask if it was on all white or all black .. probably more on all white ... and i wish the glowing part was more in focus</td>', 'i think you would have impast of the image and mask if it was on all white or all black .. probably more on all white ... and i wish the glowing part was more in focus', '2005-06-22 20:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476535, 190427, 368, '<td valign="top">i can understand what you were going for - but all i see is a "shopping mall" building of some sort and not something in a fantasy world ... maybe if the colors were tweaked in a manner that would make it look more other world like it would help ...</td>', 'i can understand what you were going for - but all i see is a "shopping mall" building of some sort and not something in a fantasy world ... maybe if the colors were tweaked in a manner that would make it look more other world like it would help ...', '2005-06-22 20:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
