(1476541, 192089, 368, '<td valign="top">i like the concept - but the filter may be a little too much .. it''s kinda hard on my eyes to look at and enjoy ... but that''s just my opinion</td>', 'i like the concept - but the filter may be a little too much .. it''s kinda hard on my eyes to look at and enjoy ... but that''s just my opinion', '2005-06-22 20:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
