(1476668, 192439, 19746, '<td valign="top">Clever perspective on this one to create the feeling of a hand coming through a portal (or something) from some sort of fantasy world.  Hand looks a little fake but the plastic nature of the hand could just be a characteristic of said world.  I like the stark tones on this one, but I feel the photo lacks a certain aesthetic punch.<br/> <br/>Good luck for the challenge!  <br/>Alex (6)</td>', 'Clever perspective on this one to create the feeling of a hand coming through a portal (or something) from some sort of fantasy world.  Hand looks a little fake but the plastic nature of the hand could just be a characteristic of said world.  I like the stark tones on this one, but I feel the photo lacks a certain aesthetic punch. Good luck for the challenge!  Alex (6)', '2005-06-22 20:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476683, 191414, 19746, '<td valign="top">You should have saved this for the leadings lines challenge ;) <br/> <br/>I like this shot, the road makes it less fantasy-ish to me, though.  The poles are also quite distracting, but I think you''ve capture something quite beautiful here.<br/> <br/>A 7 from me<br/>Alex</td>', 'You should have saved this for the leadings lines challenge ;)  I like this shot, the road makes it less fantasy-ish to me, though.  The poles are also quite distracting, but I think you''ve capture something quite beautiful here. A 7 from meAlex', '2005-06-22 20:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476687, 190484, 19746, '<td valign="top">I think there''s far too much manipulation in this photo, although I like the colours.  Invocative of ''fantasy'' though, so you meet the challenge, and this shot is aesthetically pleasing too!<br/> <br/>I''m compelled to vote low because of the obvious and extensive manipulation of this image which, although within the rules, is far too manipulated for my tastes.<br/> <br/>4 for meeting the challenge with an attractive image, but this isn''t really photography IMO.<br/> <br/>Sorry to vote so low :(<br/>Alex</td>', 'I think there''s far too much manipulation in this photo, although I like the colours.  Invocative of ''fantasy'' though, so you meet the challenge, and this shot is aesthetically pleasing too! I''m compelled to vote low because of the obvious and extensive manipulation of this image which, although within the rules, is far too manipulated for my tastes. 4 for meeting the challenge with an attractive image, but this isn''t really photography IMO. Sorry to vote so low :(Alex', '2005-06-22 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476691, 192457, 19746, '<td valign="top">Made me chuckle, not as much as the tin foil g-string picture in the metal challenge, though ;)<br/> <br/>8 for fantastic originality, contrasts and execution.  The tinfoil must have been a bit of a nightmare to work with!<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Made me chuckle, not as much as the tin foil g-string picture in the metal challenge, though ;) 8 for fantastic originality, contrasts and execution.  The tinfoil must have been a bit of a nightmare to work with! Alex', '2005-06-22 20:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476698, 190958, 19746, '<td valign="top">I think your interpretation of this challenge is a bit of a stretch, but I''m all for stretching the challenge description! ;)<br/> <br/>Great tones on the jeans, nice deep blue, although I think the lighting is a little dull and the model seems a little awkward and rushed (self timer?).  I don''t like how you''ve chopped off bits and pieces and the hotspot on the right sock really does detract.  I hope my criticism helps and good luck!  :)  <br/> <br/>(5)<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'I think your interpretation of this challenge is a bit of a stretch, but I''m all for stretching the challenge description! ;) Great tones on the jeans, nice deep blue, although I think the lighting is a little dull and the model seems a little awkward and rushed (self timer?).  I don''t like how you''ve chopped off bits and pieces and the hotspot on the right sock really does detract.  I hope my criticism helps and good luck!  :)   (5) Alex', '2005-06-22 20:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476705, 190603, 36616, '<td valign="top">Sorry, although it is on challenge and the photo is technically good ( a little over full with white) It does not have the artistic elements that I am looking for in this challenge.</td>', 'Sorry, although it is on challenge and the photo is technically good ( a little over full with white) It does not have the artistic elements that I am looking for in this challenge.', '2005-06-22 20:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476709, 191559, 19746, '<td valign="top">Good idea!  Very well executed and definitely dreamlike ''n surreal enough to be something out of a fantasy world.  My only criticisms would be the crop/composition, feels like there''s something wrong but I''m not sure what.  Also, the hotspot on the face detracts very slightly, but it isn''t obvious at first so it''s extremely minor.  <br/> <br/>Congrats on your original and creative entry to this challenge, I know how difficult these can be  to execute.<br/> <br/>Good luck for the challenge! <br/> <br/>Alex (7)</td>', 'Good idea!  Very well executed and definitely dreamlike ''n surreal enough to be something out of a fantasy world.  My only criticisms would be the crop/composition, feels like there''s something wrong but I''m not sure what.  Also, the hotspot on the face detracts very slightly, but it isn''t obvious at first so it''s extremely minor.   Congrats on your original and creative entry to this challenge, I know how difficult these can be  to execute. Good luck for the challenge!  Alex (7)', '2005-06-22 20:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476714, 189512, 19746, '<td valign="top">This...is...great!<br/> <br/>You''ve photoshopped this image alot, but I don''t think you''ve overdone it (although you''re teetering on the brink!).  ;)<br/> <br/>Nicely composed, interesting colours and tones (albeit photoshop induced) and the smoke from the ''building'' really finishes this image off!  Fits the challenge perfectly and I think this will do well (although my vote of confidence is invariably the ''kiss of death'' for challenge images!).  <br/> <br/>Good luck!<br/> <br/>Alex (9)</td>', 'This...is...great! You''ve photoshopped this image alot, but I don''t think you''ve overdone it (although you''re teetering on the brink!).  ;) Nicely composed, interesting colours and tones (albeit photoshop induced) and the smoke from the ''building'' really finishes this image off!  Fits the challenge perfectly and I think this will do well (although my vote of confidence is invariably the ''kiss of death'' for challenge images!).   Good luck! Alex (9)', '2005-06-22 21:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476719, 191454, 19746, '<td valign="top">The lack of perspective regarding the size of the lizard is a fantastic inclusion (or should I say exclusion).  Great detail on his face, great DOF, great image!<br/> <br/>Good luck!<br/> <br/>Alex (8)</td>', 'The lack of perspective regarding the size of the lizard is a fantastic inclusion (or should I say exclusion).  Great detail on his face, great DOF, great image! Good luck! Alex (8)', '2005-06-22 21:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476729, 192385, 19746, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve overdone the soft focus here, but that''s okay.  I''m not gonna mark it too down for that!  I like it to an extent, but part of me wants to focus on the flowers!  <br/> <br/>Nevertheless, you''ve used a cool technique to create a dreamy and quite beautiful image.  I like how the hill rolls and your eye almost slides over the hazy yellows in this image.  Lovely analogous colour scheme here, great image!<br/> <br/>Good luck!<br/>Alex (8)<br/></td>', 'I think you''ve overdone the soft focus here, but that''s okay.  I''m not gonna mark it too down for that!  I like it to an extent, but part of me wants to focus on the flowers!   Nevertheless, you''ve used a cool technique to create a dreamy and quite beautiful image.  I like how the hill rolls and your eye almost slides over the hazy yellows in this image.  Lovely analogous colour scheme here, great image! Good luck!Alex (8)', '2005-06-22 21:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476731, 190603, 19746, '<td valign="top">Certainly fits the challenge!  ;)</td>', 'Certainly fits the challenge!  ;)', '2005-06-22 21:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476761, 190841, 6667, '<td valign="top">And there probably still wouldn''t be enough places for seagulls to perch!  BOL</td>', 'And there probably still wouldn''t be enough places for seagulls to perch!  BOL', '2005-06-22 21:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476794, 190532, 19746, '<td valign="top">I know this filter!  Plastic wrap!<br/> <br/>Very strange effect but I like it just for it''s audacious weirdness.  I''m not a fan of overphotoshopping though so I''ve docked a coupla points for that.  Lovely colours, though and you''ve done well to retain an obvious subject in a busy image.<br/> <br/>Good luck with the challenge<br/>Alex (7)</td>', 'I know this filter!  Plastic wrap! Very strange effect but I like it just for it''s audacious weirdness.  I''m not a fan of overphotoshopping though so I''ve docked a coupla points for that.  Lovely colours, though and you''ve done well to retain an obvious subject in a busy image. Good luck with the challengeAlex (7)', '2005-06-22 21:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476804, 190332, 19746, '<td valign="top">A little small for my liking and too much dark foreground negative space.  I like the yellow tones, though.  Good luck for the challenge!<br/> <br/>Alex (6)</td>', 'A little small for my liking and too much dark foreground negative space.  I like the yellow tones, though.  Good luck for the challenge! Alex (6)', '2005-06-22 21:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476817, 191532, 36499, '<td valign="top">where can i get me one of these? got a spare?</td>', 'where can i get me one of these? got a spare?', '2005-06-22 21:42:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1476818, 192444, 19746, '<td valign="top">An interesting snippet of a teenage party, reminds me of school!  I don''t really think this fits the challenge, however, and technically there''re a lot of shortcomings.  The background elements are quite distracting, particularly that girl in the background.  She really ''steals the show'' away from the subject.  Perhaps try a shallower DOF.<br/> <br/>I like the genuine feel to this photo, but it doesn''t really work in the challenge context and, overall, is far too snapshotty.<br/> <br/>Good luck<br/>Alex (4)</td>', 'An interesting snippet of a teenage party, reminds me of school!  I don''t really think this fits the challenge, however, and technically there''re a lot of shortcomings.  The background elements are quite distracting, particularly that girl in the background.  She really ''steals the show'' away from the subject.  Perhaps try a shallower DOF. I like the genuine feel to this photo, but it doesn''t really work in the challenge context and, overall, is far too snapshotty. Good luckAlex (4)', '2005-06-22 21:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476820, 191234, 19746, '<td valign="top">Great tones on this one!  Congratulations on a very interesting shot that uses negative space extremely well!<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Great tones on this one!  Congratulations on a very interesting shot that uses negative space extremely well! Alex', '2005-06-22 21:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476822, 192166, 36499, '<td valign="top">after voting is over i will be checking to see how this was done! what a great great photo!</td>', 'after voting is over i will be checking to see how this was done! what a great great photo!', '2005-06-22 21:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476829, 190988, 19746, '<td valign="top">The Gherkin Building!  A DPC challenge favourite ;)<br/> <br/>Lovely paradox here, that building is pretty fantasy worldish by itself, and I think you''ve emphasized that feel with the inclusion of a the more traditional structure in the foreground.<br/> <br/>Good luck with the challenge!<br/>Alex (8)</td>', 'The Gherkin Building!  A DPC challenge favourite ;) Lovely paradox here, that building is pretty fantasy worldish by itself, and I think you''ve emphasized that feel with the inclusion of a the more traditional structure in the foreground. Good luck with the challenge!Alex (8)', '2005-06-22 21:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1476832, 190929, 19746, '<td valign="top">Hahahaa. <br/> <br/>Very amusing (attractive colours too!)</td>', 'Hahahaa.  Very amusing (attractive colours too!)', '2005-06-22 21:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
