(1477520, 190532, 9089, '<td valign="top">Photo has too much going on, no real central focus to make the score jump.  If the background had been faded out, not so bright would improve the picture</td>', 'Photo has too much going on, no real central focus to make the score jump.  If the background had been faded out, not so bright would improve the picture', '2005-06-23 03:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477521, 191391, 9089, '<td valign="top">Picture is ok, simply because of the mottling of the trees shadows.  Even lighting with a reflector or fill flash would help this.  As it is, my eyes are drawn to the bright spots on the pants and the bottom of the dress instead of to the faces and eyes and costumes and house.</td>', 'Picture is ok, simply because of the mottling of the trees shadows.  Even lighting with a reflector or fill flash would help this.  As it is, my eyes are drawn to the bright spots on the pants and the bottom of the dress instead of to the faces and eyes and costumes and house.', '2005-06-23 03:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477525, 192487, 9089, '<td valign="top">Picture needs a slight clockwise rotation to place it level.  Colors are good, action is good, background even though outside the DOF is still too busy/bright, maybe some burning would help.</td>', 'Picture needs a slight clockwise rotation to place it level.  Colors are good, action is good, background even though outside the DOF is still too busy/bright, maybe some burning would help.', '2005-06-23 03:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477529, 189944, 9089, '<td valign="top">It is an interesting picture, unfortunately it is not recognizable in any way, so it makes it hard to ''keep'' my interest.  After looking at it for a little while, my eyes get tired and I must move on to another picture.  Maybe a different perspective which would show either a larger or smaller aspect of this object would help.</td>', 'It is an interesting picture, unfortunately it is not recognizable in any way, so it makes it hard to ''keep'' my interest.  After looking at it for a little while, my eyes get tired and I must move on to another picture.  Maybe a different perspective which would show either a larger or smaller aspect of this object would help.', '2005-06-23 03:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477531, 191033, 9089, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing double exposure.  Picture is good, wish it was rotated a little clockwise, as the lean bothers me.  Bumping up a point for the work that went into thinking this photo out, but not for the double exposure (sorry just personal preference).</td>', 'I''m guessing double exposure.  Picture is good, wish it was rotated a little clockwise, as the lean bothers me.  Bumping up a point for the work that went into thinking this photo out, but not for the double exposure (sorry just personal preference).', '2005-06-23 03:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477532, 192046, 9089, '<td valign="top">How can anyone not like Arches National Park there in UT.  This picture would do better if it was tied closer to the theme of the challenge.  As it is one of the more famous ''natural'' places in this world, it doesn''t seem to fit as much in another one.  But it is a good composition, and you did have to hike to get up to it, so 6</td>', 'How can anyone not like Arches National Park there in UT.  This picture would do better if it was tied closer to the theme of the challenge.  As it is one of the more famous ''natural'' places in this world, it doesn''t seem to fit as much in another one.  But it is a good composition, and you did have to hike to get up to it, so 6', '2005-06-23 03:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1477535, 192480, 9089, '<td valign="top">Being a toy will not help, but you have done as much as I think is possible to transform it from a simple toy that could be done to make it look realistic.  Coloration in the photo is good, lighting I think is excellent as is the DOF.  6</td>', 'Being a toy will not help, but you have done as much as I think is possible to transform it from a simple toy that could be done to make it look realistic.  Coloration in the photo is good, lighting I think is excellent as is the DOF.  6', '2005-06-23 03:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
