(1478140, 189374, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  The blossoms are lovely &amp; the DOF adds to the effect beautifully.  For MY eye, I''d have preferred that you crop the leaves out of the bottom of the pic, but that is one man''s opinion... 7</td>', 'Nice photo.  The blossoms are lovely & the DOF adds to the effect beautifully.  For MY eye, I''d have preferred that you crop the leaves out of the bottom of the pic, but that is one man''s opinion... 7', '2005-06-23 12:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
