(1478231, 192199, 17610, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2005-06-23 12:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478254, 189945, 9089, '<td valign="top">The picture is not bad for the darkness and the softness, since that is helping to establish the reality of the alien.  I guess when I look at the picture, I just can''t buy the eye points.  If they are really in the original photograph, then forgive me, but they seem to be dodges in post processing.  However, I still like the photo overall. 6</td>', 'The picture is not bad for the darkness and the softness, since that is helping to establish the reality of the alien.  I guess when I look at the picture, I just can''t buy the eye points.  If they are really in the original photograph, then forgive me, but they seem to be dodges in post processing.  However, I still like the photo overall. 6', '2005-06-23 12:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478260, 191564, 9089, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouette.  Two things hurt this picture, first being that it is easy to see that this is a toy/model being shot, secondly the light in the background.  The branches are what really help the shot.  6</td>', 'I like the silhouette.  Two things hurt this picture, first being that it is easy to see that this is a toy/model being shot, secondly the light in the background.  The branches are what really help the shot.  6', '2005-06-23 12:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478266, 191370, 9089, '<td valign="top">I find myself trying to figure out what is in the background as I look through the bubbles.  Clarity and color make the picture interesting.  The implied triangle between the 3 larger bubbles makes the composition.  I would though clone out some of the smaller bubbles to give more clarity to the image overall.  6</td>', 'I find myself trying to figure out what is in the background as I look through the bubbles.  Clarity and color make the picture interesting.  The implied triangle between the 3 larger bubbles makes the composition.  I would though clone out some of the smaller bubbles to give more clarity to the image overall.  6', '2005-06-23 12:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478273, 190897, 9089, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very good in this photo.  Interesting use of the marble/glass ball.  Picture though doesn''t relaly draw me into itself as I''m trying to find a focal point to it.  You used negative space, but I think it needs to be more to make the ball more of a focus.</td>', 'The lighting is very good in this photo.  Interesting use of the marble/glass ball.  Picture though doesn''t relaly draw me into itself as I''m trying to find a focal point to it.  You used negative space, but I think it needs to be more to make the ball more of a focus.', '2005-06-23 12:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478279, 192143, 9089, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space.  I like the b&amp;w conversion, and the grain works.  6</td>', 'Great use of negative space.  I like the b&w conversion, and the grain works.  6', '2005-06-23 12:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478281, 192414, 9089, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this photo, but just in my opinion I don''t like the skull in the middle.  I think you could almost do this without anything there.  6</td>', 'I enjoy this photo, but just in my opinion I don''t like the skull in the middle.  I think you could almost do this without anything there.  6', '2005-06-23 12:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478288, 190016, 9089, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this photo a couple of times.  I like the lighting (especially on the clouds from the large tower), although I wish that we saw some reflection of the lights in the water.  Also, the pincushioning could be fixed with perspective in PS. 6</td>', 'I''ve looked at this photo a couple of times.  I like the lighting (especially on the clouds from the large tower), although I wish that we saw some reflection of the lights in the water.  Also, the pincushioning could be fixed with perspective in PS. 6', '2005-06-23 13:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478290, 190550, 9089, '<td valign="top">Although the picture is small (you should resize the longest side to 640, the composition is very interesting.  5</td>', 'Although the picture is small (you should resize the longest side to 640, the composition is very interesting.  5', '2005-06-23 13:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478315, 190957, 9089, '<td valign="top">Parallels between the windmills and the posts in the forground tie the picture together.  I''m not sure if I like the angle of the photo.  5</td>', 'Parallels between the windmills and the posts in the forground tie the picture together.  I''m not sure if I like the angle of the photo.  5', '2005-06-23 13:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478324, 192409, 9089, '<td valign="top">I think the composition of this one is better than the blue one which is like this, but I like the lighting on the blue one better, maybe a little more light from the side on the ball would be better.  6</td>', 'I think the composition of this one is better than the blue one which is like this, but I like the lighting on the blue one better, maybe a little more light from the side on the ball would be better.  6', '2005-06-23 13:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478329, 189704, 9089, '<td valign="top">You Icelander''s and your settings just are fabulous.  The people give the shot tremendous perspective, although they also work against the title of the picture.  I do like the B&amp;W conversion. 6</td>', 'You Icelander''s and your settings just are fabulous.  The people give the shot tremendous perspective, although they also work against the title of the picture.  I do like the B&W conversion. 6', '2005-06-23 13:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478339, 191415, 9089, '<td valign="top">The circular composition helps the dreaminess of the picture.  Lighting is good.  I do wish the fairy on the left was all inside the picture.  6</td>', 'The circular composition helps the dreaminess of the picture.  Lighting is good.  I do wish the fairy on the left was all inside the picture.  6', '2005-06-23 13:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478348, 191495, 9089, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  The colors and the blur work good to tie in to the title, as does the hint of the people through the window.  I do see a haloing on the top of the car probably from sharpening.  You can fix that with some careful smudging.  6</td>', 'I like this photo.  The colors and the blur work good to tie in to the title, as does the hint of the people through the window.  I do see a haloing on the top of the car probably from sharpening.  You can fix that with some careful smudging.  6', '2005-06-23 13:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478354, 192339, 9089, '<td valign="top">Creative use of color adjustment, but doesn''t speak much to me.  I find it just a little dark.  Still a 6 for being one of the few pictures that is trying to go to a fantasy world.</td>', 'Creative use of color adjustment, but doesn''t speak much to me.  I find it just a little dark.  Still a 6 for being one of the few pictures that is trying to go to a fantasy world.', '2005-06-23 13:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478356, 192353, 9089, '<td valign="top">Sharpness and lighting are good in this picture.  A little more clarity in what the picture is would help to boost the score, as it is, it makes for a good abstract.  6</td>', 'Sharpness and lighting are good in this picture.  A little more clarity in what the picture is would help to boost the score, as it is, it makes for a good abstract.  6', '2005-06-23 13:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478360, 191454, 9089, '<td valign="top">Classic movie scene.  I do think the highlights are just a little too bright (some of the horns on his cheek and the spikes on his back), which draw attention away from the eye which should be the focus.  DOF is good with the eye really sharp, but my eye keeps wandering down to his cheek/jowels.  6</td>', 'Classic movie scene.  I do think the highlights are just a little too bright (some of the horns on his cheek and the spikes on his back), which draw attention away from the eye which should be the focus.  DOF is good with the eye really sharp, but my eye keeps wandering down to his cheek/jowels.  6', '2005-06-23 13:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1478361, 192288, 9089, '<td valign="top">Not a real fan of the post processing done on this photo.</td>', 'Not a real fan of the post processing done on this photo.', '2005-06-23 13:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
