(1478468, 190532, 37234, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting photo, I''ll give you that, but I have a personal dislike for "generic" Photoshop filters, and I''ve only found 1 or 2 uses for this particular one. The more I look, the more I''m able to look past the filter, but overall I find it a distraction.</td>', 'It''s an interesting photo, I''ll give you that, but I have a personal dislike for "generic" Photoshop filters, and I''ve only found 1 or 2 uses for this particular one. The more I look, the more I''m able to look past the filter, but overall I find it a distraction.', '2005-06-23 14:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
