(1479011, 191050, 9089, '<td valign="top">I understand the fantasy concept of their never being peace in this world, and it is depicted by the guns and war toys in the trash can.  I really appreciate the flower stuck in the gun barrel.  I guess what bothers me the most about the photo, is that it is shot in a setting that makes me wonder, "Why is there a trash can in the middle of a field?"  I would really think that this would need to be placed in an urban setting to get the most impact from the photo.  A smaller DOF would also be helpful to focus the attention on the can and guns, instead of on the bright (and interesting) grasses and flowers in the background.</td>', 'I understand the fantasy concept of their never being peace in this world, and it is depicted by the guns and war toys in the trash can.  I really appreciate the flower stuck in the gun barrel.  I guess what bothers me the most about the photo, is that it is shot in a setting that makes me wonder, "Why is there a trash can in the middle of a field?"  I would really think that this would need to be placed in an urban setting to get the most impact from the photo.  A smaller DOF would also be helpful to focus the attention on the can and guns, instead of on the bright (and interesting) grasses and flowers in the background.', '2005-06-23 17:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479017, 191541, 9089, '<td valign="top">While this may be seen in another world, it has no interest to me.  It seems like a blurry bunch of colors.  Sorry.</td>', 'While this may be seen in another world, it has no interest to me.  It seems like a blurry bunch of colors.  Sorry.', '2005-06-23 17:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479022, 190991, 9089, '<td valign="top">While a purple sky may be seen in another world, the circular panning does not really help me want to look at th ephoto, rather, it makes me dizzy and want to click on to the next one.  Sorry.</td>', 'While a purple sky may be seen in another world, the circular panning does not really help me want to look at th ephoto, rather, it makes me dizzy and want to click on to the next one.  Sorry.', '2005-06-23 17:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
