(1479080, 192166, 9089, '<td valign="top">Orlando''s Wonder Works Building.  Hopefully the tornado that brought this building from the Bermuda Triangle didn''t bother you too much.  It is an interesting building, but the crop just doesn''t make the photo.  I would also clone out the branches in the top left corner.</td>', 'Orlando''s Wonder Works Building.  Hopefully the tornado that brought this building from the Bermuda Triangle didn''t bother you too much.  It is an interesting building, but the crop just doesn''t make the photo.  I would also clone out the branches in the top left corner.', '2005-06-23 17:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479123, 192472, 30896, '<td valign="top">nice, though i would prefer the ball to be in focus as a whole and the colors more in tune (esp. traces of green in overall blue picture)</td>', 'nice, though i would prefer the ball to be in focus as a whole and the colors more in tune (esp. traces of green in overall blue picture)', '2005-06-23 17:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479151, 191162, 5792, '<td valign="top">Color, lighting and framing are excellent without excessive noise.<br/> <br/>This natural looking image fits the challenge perfectly in a way most all voters can recognize. The Gandolf character is outstanding and the misty look a nice touch. That coupled with its high technical quality will likely put this in the ribbons with the blue possible.<br/> <br/>On a technical note a few things can be said.<br/> <br/>There is some minor haloing around the main characters garments near the top that can be removed.<br/> <br/>The nearest leaves are out of focus. It could be validly argued it is that way on purpose to convey the sense of a journey through middle earth but most viewers will probably find that slightly distracting. That is generally true of most foreground elements that occupy a prominent position in a composition.<br/> <br/>The image is lower contrast. Even a simple autocontrast adjustment will add considerable "pop" to an already amazing image. Again it might be said low contrast is purposeful to retain greater image detail and a sense of the mystical but most viewrs would likely think the added "pop" outweighs the other items.<br/> <br/>If this image fails to get the blue ribbon it is likely because of the contrast.<br/> <br/>A super photograph! Kudos to you for a great shot!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-27 03:20:32.</i></td>', 'Color, lighting and framing are excellent without excessive noise. This natural looking image fits the challenge perfectly in a way most all voters can recognize. The Gandolf character is outstanding and the misty look a nice touch. That coupled with its high technical quality will likely put this in the ribbons with the blue possible. On a technical note a few things can be said. There is some minor haloing around the main characters garments near the top that can be removed. The nearest leaves are out of focus. It could be validly argued it is that way on purpose to convey the sense of a journey through middle earth but most viewers will probably find that slightly distracting. That is generally true of most foreground elements that occupy a prominent position in a composition. The image is lower contrast. Even a simple autocontrast adjustment will add considerable "pop" to an already amazing image. Again it might be said low contrast is purposeful to retain greater image detail and a sense of the mystical but most viewrs would likely think the added "pop" outweighs the other items. If this image fails to get the blue ribbon it is likely because of the contrast. A super photograph! Kudos to you for a great shot!', '2005-06-23 17:52:03.000000', '2005-06-27 04:20:32.000000', 1),
(1479171, 190650, 5792, '<td valign="top">An excellent stock photo image. Very clean and the lighting is outstanding without any overexposed areas. The iPod looks surrealistic.<br/> <br/>Some viewers will feel this image does not fit the challenge topic and will vote it lower.<br/> <br/>Technically there is little wrong with it. It does seem a little unbalanced with darkening between the left and right side of the image but that may be just individual taste. If the middle left side were darked about 15-20% more than it be balanced better with the right side.<br/> <br/>Good picture.</td>', 'An excellent stock photo image. Very clean and the lighting is outstanding without any overexposed areas. The iPod looks surrealistic. Some viewers will feel this image does not fit the challenge topic and will vote it lower. Technically there is little wrong with it. It does seem a little unbalanced with darkening between the left and right side of the image but that may be just individual taste. If the middle left side were darked about 15-20% more than it be balanced better with the right side. Good picture.', '2005-06-23 17:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479202, 190957, 5792, '<td valign="top">The fog with the wind generators is the main strength of the image and the connection to the challenge theme. Most voters will make the connection. The trees silhouetted against the fog is also super nice. <br/> <br/>Most of the really interesting elements are tiny in the frame. Zooming in or cropping out a lot of the image would make the composition stronger. You could crop from just below the fence posts to the left of the trees upward and righ to just above the dark bank of clouds. This will include everything interesting and get rid of the rest that is repetative and less intersting. You might consider making this B&amp;W.</td>', 'The fog with the wind generators is the main strength of the image and the connection to the challenge theme. Most voters will make the connection. The trees silhouetted against the fog is also super nice.  Most of the really interesting elements are tiny in the frame. Zooming in or cropping out a lot of the image would make the composition stronger. You could crop from just below the fence posts to the left of the trees upward and righ to just above the dark bank of clouds. This will include everything interesting and get rid of the rest that is repetative and less intersting. You might consider making this B&W.', '2005-06-23 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479226, 192089, 36616, '<td valign="top">The poor focus spoils this for me - If I miss the point I apologise</td>', 'The poor focus spoils this for me - If I miss the point I apologise', '2005-06-23 18:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479229, 192478, 36616, '<td valign="top">Really needs the single horn! Nice pic</td>', 'Really needs the single horn! Nice pic', '2005-06-23 18:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479237, 192313, 5792, '<td valign="top">A fairly nice abstract composition of ocean muscles. A nifty idea! Your title fits the clustered group creatively well though it usually refers to flower groupings.<br/> <br/>Some viewers will find the out of focus muscles at the top of the frame are distracting. They may also feel the colors are artificially manipulated and give lower scores.<br/> <br/>The focus is on the soft side and detail mottled and the central focal point does not have lots to offer.</td>', 'A fairly nice abstract composition of ocean muscles. A nifty idea! Your title fits the clustered group creatively well though it usually refers to flower groupings. Some viewers will find the out of focus muscles at the top of the frame are distracting. They may also feel the colors are artificially manipulated and give lower scores. The focus is on the soft side and detail mottled and the central focal point does not have lots to offer.', '2005-06-23 18:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479242, 190532, 12611, '<td valign="top">THis is both fascinating and ugly as sin. I love it!</td>', 'THis is both fascinating and ugly as sin. I love it!', '2005-06-23 18:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479253, 190929, 5792, '<td valign="top">Curious composition with interesting colors and a good solid black background. Good concept!<br/> <br/>Some viewers may find the use of a doll unrealistic. I know, sounds dumb in a fantasy challenge but people often expect the illusion of reality in their fantasies. I always do with my fantasies about women. :)<br/> <br/>It is hard to tell exactly what the glass support is and it does not add lots to the composition. You might consider cropping it down so the the whole support is not included in the composition.<br/> <br/>The focus is a little soft and will be interpreted as indicating a lower quality image.</td>', 'Curious composition with interesting colors and a good solid black background. Good concept! Some viewers may find the use of a doll unrealistic. I know, sounds dumb in a fantasy challenge but people often expect the illusion of reality in their fantasies. I always do with my fantasies about women. :) It is hard to tell exactly what the glass support is and it does not add lots to the composition. You might consider cropping it down so the the whole support is not included in the composition. The focus is a little soft and will be interpreted as indicating a lower quality image.', '2005-06-23 18:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479274, 190953, 5792, '<td valign="top">In general a nice floral macro with good pink tones and low noise.<br/> <br/>Florals are common challenge entries so will not be thought of as having a strong fantasy connection for many viewers.<br/> <br/>On the technical side the black inner borders near the top and left center petals have some black harshness that could be removed with simple cloning. Florals like this often look better if the center is placed according to the rule of thirds. jmsetzler''s "Pianissimo" is a classic example of that.<br/> <br/>Overall a nice capture.</td>', 'In general a nice floral macro with good pink tones and low noise. Florals are common challenge entries so will not be thought of as having a strong fantasy connection for many viewers. On the technical side the black inner borders near the top and left center petals have some black harshness that could be removed with simple cloning. Florals like this often look better if the center is placed according to the rule of thirds. jmsetzler''s "Pianissimo" is a classic example of that. Overall a nice capture.', '2005-06-23 18:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479295, 191307, 24454, '<td valign="top">You''re probably hearing this a lot, but this HAS to be one of the top 3, if not the top spot.  It''s truly an amazing photograph that conveys the challenge topic beautifully!  10</td>', 'You''re probably hearing this a lot, but this HAS to be one of the top 3, if not the top spot.  It''s truly an amazing photograph that conveys the challenge topic beautifully!  10', '2005-06-23 18:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479297, 189944, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very abstract and cool looking.    I keep looking at this wondering how it was accomplished.  I like it!!!!   :)</td>', 'Very abstract and cool looking.    I keep looking at this wondering how it was accomplished.  I like it!!!!   :)', '2005-06-23 18:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479310, 192330, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at a fantasy world with the times exposure headlight trail and low-saturation colors. Use of the rule of thirds adds interest. Looks like a juxtaposition of old and new. The lighting at the bottom of the monument is curiously interesting.<br/> <br/>Telephone poles and wires generally are distracting items. The should probably be removed from this compostion. They destroy the illusion of a fantasy world. The composition would be stronger if there were something in the lower left. The white spot over on that side is distracting.</td>', 'Good attempt at a fantasy world with the times exposure headlight trail and low-saturation colors. Use of the rule of thirds adds interest. Looks like a juxtaposition of old and new. The lighting at the bottom of the monument is curiously interesting. Telephone poles and wires generally are distracting items. The should probably be removed from this compostion. They destroy the illusion of a fantasy world. The composition would be stronger if there were something in the lower left. The white spot over on that side is distracting.', '2005-06-23 18:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479324, 192442, 5792, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept. Particularly intersting is that it consists of recognizable structs from different cities. Including the reflection is good.<br/> <br/>Looks like a black dropcloth or electronic noise is visible in the black background. This should be corrected to be solid black or made twinfling green or something.<br/> <br/>The general image quality is weak and that will affect it in voting.</td>', 'An interesting concept. Particularly intersting is that it consists of recognizable structs from different cities. Including the reflection is good. Looks like a black dropcloth or electronic noise is visible in the black background. This should be corrected to be solid black or made twinfling green or something. The general image quality is weak and that will affect it in voting.', '2005-06-23 18:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479353, 190850, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great attempt for this challenge. The fine detail clarity in it is FANTASTIC and the similar trees are good choices for your experiment. The grey background is a great idea. <br/> <br/>It will be interesting to see how viewrers react to it, but if left to just technical quality then this image should place very high.<br/> <br/>On the technical side the bottom left of the center blue tree looks like it migh flow over the true boundary and the amount of foreground grass may be  little more than the composition needs.<br/> <br/>Like this image a lot.</td>', 'Great attempt for this challenge. The fine detail clarity in it is FANTASTIC and the similar trees are good choices for your experiment. The grey background is a great idea.  It will be interesting to see how viewrers react to it, but if left to just technical quality then this image should place very high. On the technical side the bottom left of the center blue tree looks like it migh flow over the true boundary and the amount of foreground grass may be  little more than the composition needs. Like this image a lot.', '2005-06-23 18:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479369, 192320, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette and medieval concept. Clouds give the sky definition.<br/> <br/>The overexposed area at the center of the image is a major distraction that will hurt this image in voting. There is some digital ''jaggies'' along the horizon edge that should be cloned out to make a nice stark black edge. You might consider some dodge and burn to add more texture and interest to the clouds.</td>', 'Nice silhouette and medieval concept. Clouds give the sky definition. The overexposed area at the center of the image is a major distraction that will hurt this image in voting. There is some digital ''jaggies'' along the horizon edge that should be cloned out to make a nice stark black edge. You might consider some dodge and burn to add more texture and interest to the clouds.', '2005-06-23 18:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479397, 192414, 5792, '<td valign="top">A marvelous image! The color and composition are excellent and a high quality technical image. The light painting is great.<br/> <br/>The only technical flaw is some minor haloing around the toip left of the skull. That could easily be cloned out. You might consider slightly darkening the two brighter white spots at the top of the skull.<br/> <br/>This is one of the very best images in the challenge.</td>', 'A marvelous image! The color and composition are excellent and a high quality technical image. The light painting is great. The only technical flaw is some minor haloing around the toip left of the skull. That could easily be cloned out. You might consider slightly darkening the two brighter white spots at the top of the skull. This is one of the very best images in the challenge.', '2005-06-23 19:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479410, 192483, 5792, '<td valign="top">The green tones are nice and the blades of grass add flow to the composition. It has a technical blurred quality to it that is likable.<br/> <br/>Most viewer''s will feel your attempt to use movement to create a fantasy world with ordinary objects is not that successful and vote this image lower. There are several others like yours in this challenge that will similarly suffer.</td>', 'The green tones are nice and the blades of grass add flow to the composition. It has a technical blurred quality to it that is likable. Most viewer''s will feel your attempt to use movement to create a fantasy world with ordinary objects is not that successful and vote this image lower. There are several others like yours in this challenge that will similarly suffer.', '2005-06-23 19:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479432, 190532, 5792, '<td valign="top">Decent color, detail and image quality. Composition is OK. Good subject for the challenge.<br/> <br/>On the technical side the contrast is just a little weak and a simple autocontrast will add pop to the image. You might consider a color adjustment to add about 10-15% saturation to yellow, red and light blue for added viewer interest. A small amount of dodge and burn would give the image more texture.</td>', 'Decent color, detail and image quality. Composition is OK. Good subject for the challenge. On the technical side the contrast is just a little weak and a simple autocontrast will add pop to the image. You might consider a color adjustment to add about 10-15% saturation to yellow, red and light blue for added viewer interest. A small amount of dodge and burn would give the image more texture.', '2005-06-23 19:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479445, 190550, 5792, '<td valign="top">A good idea that gets within the concept of a fantasy world.<br/> <br/>Compositionally it might be a little better if you included the full oval that is cut off at the bottom center of the frame. This is a very hard image to get the exposure correct because it is several stops brighter in the center than the rest of the frame. That will be distracting for some viewers.<br/> <br/>The darker reddish inside may look artificially colored and cause it to get a lower score. You might try making the orangish color brighter or more shimmering.</td>', 'A good idea that gets within the concept of a fantasy world. Compositionally it might be a little better if you included the full oval that is cut off at the bottom center of the frame. This is a very hard image to get the exposure correct because it is several stops brighter in the center than the rest of the frame. That will be distracting for some viewers. The darker reddish inside may look artificially colored and cause it to get a lower score. You might try making the orangish color brighter or more shimmering.', '2005-06-23 19:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479451, 190957, 39735, '<td valign="top">Very nice entry for Fantasy World.</td>', 'Very nice entry for Fantasy World.', '2005-06-23 19:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479452, 192139, 39735, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot!</td>', 'Nice Shot!', '2005-06-23 19:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479455, 192448, 5792, '<td valign="top">A fascinating and good composition. Nice the way you have the bottom stem go to the lower right corner. B&amp;W is a great choice for this picture. General image quality is good but not great. It has a few digital ''jaggies'' along some edges.</td>', 'A fascinating and good composition. Nice the way you have the bottom stem go to the lower right corner. B&W is a great choice for this picture. General image quality is good but not great. It has a few digital ''jaggies'' along some edges.', '2005-06-23 19:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479462, 189704, 5792, '<td valign="top">A good try at a fantasy world. The people add perspective to the grandeur of the scene.<br/> <br/>Most of the lower frame and snow is overexposed. This will be a distraction for most viewers. The rocks have a granular appearance that will be interpreted as a poorer quality image. It is very difficult to get fine detail like that to be focused properly.</td>', 'A good try at a fantasy world. The people add perspective to the grandeur of the scene. Most of the lower frame and snow is overexposed. This will be a distraction for most viewers. The rocks have a granular appearance that will be interpreted as a poorer quality image. It is very difficult to get fine detail like that to be focused properly.', '2005-06-23 19:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479471, 192385, 5792, '<td valign="top">You have successfully created a fantasy world with color and soft image processing. Green and yellow together are very appealing to the eye. This is a tranquil image that will have strong appeal to some viewers.<br/> <br/>Some viewers may wonder what the objects at the top right side of the frame are and may even think they are distractions.</td>', 'You have successfully created a fantasy world with color and soft image processing. Green and yellow together are very appealing to the eye. This is a tranquil image that will have strong appeal to some viewers. Some viewers may wonder what the objects at the top right side of the frame are and may even think they are distractions.', '2005-06-23 19:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479675, 191559, 32754, '<td valign="top">Well done, good lighting and shadow effects.</td>', 'Well done, good lighting and shadow effects.', '2005-06-23 20:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479680, 191162, 32754, '<td valign="top">Great fantasy picture.. love the smoky background, the costume and the leaves in the foreground for depth.</td>', 'Great fantasy picture.. love the smoky background, the costume and the leaves in the foreground for depth.', '2005-06-23 20:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479683, 192320, 32754, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  makes me think of those ninja movies; the lighting is excellent and the silhouette of the person and the building give added mystery.</td>', 'Cool shot!  makes me think of those ninja movies; the lighting is excellent and the silhouette of the person and the building give added mystery.', '2005-06-23 21:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479831, 192478, 3214, '<td valign="top">pretty cool effect!</td>', 'pretty cool effect!', '2005-06-23 22:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479881, 190953, 4767, '<td valign="top">lovely macro, but I think you need to expand your fantasies. It seems a lot like a reality...  6</td>', 'lovely macro, but I think you need to expand your fantasies. It seems a lot like a reality...  6', '2005-06-23 22:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479886, 192230, 4767, '<td valign="top">a highly interesting shot.  I love the intensity of the foreground colors, even though I fear it''s a form of pond scum...</td>', 'a highly interesting shot.  I love the intensity of the foreground colors, even though I fear it''s a form of pond scum...', '2005-06-23 22:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479894, 191234, 4767, '<td valign="top">Why do I find myself looking for Robert Johnson in this photo?</td>', 'Why do I find myself looking for Robert Johnson in this photo?', '2005-06-23 22:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479900, 192481, 4767, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot except for the border.  Somehow sucks the subtlety out of the pic.</td>', 'Terrific shot except for the border.  Somehow sucks the subtlety out of the pic.', '2005-06-23 22:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479904, 192466, 4767, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is truly scary to me!</td>', 'Now THAT is truly scary to me!', '2005-06-23 22:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479925, 192313, 368, '<td valign="top">not quite sure what this is ... but i do like the color contrast ... just wish i could make out what it is</td>', 'not quite sure what this is ... but i do like the color contrast ... just wish i could make out what it is', '2005-06-23 23:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479928, 191414, 368, '<td valign="top">i really like the feel of this image ... the cloud/fog capture ads a nice touch to the highway - certainly reminds me of a dream or fantasy - 7</td>', 'i really like the feel of this image ... the cloud/fog capture ads a nice touch to the highway - certainly reminds me of a dream or fantasy - 7', '2005-06-23 23:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479931, 192213, 368, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful landscape and sky capture - but it''s not really screaming fantasy world ... but everyone is different and can have their own fantasy world :)</td>', 'this is a beautiful landscape and sky capture - but it''s not really screaming fantasy world ... but everyone is different and can have their own fantasy world :)', '2005-06-23 23:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479933, 191454, 368, '<td valign="top">excellent detail on its scales and face and mouth ... lizards are so much fun to capture on camera ... i guess in your fantasy world they rule the world huh?</td>', 'excellent detail on its scales and face and mouth ... lizards are so much fun to capture on camera ... i guess in your fantasy world they rule the world huh?', '2005-06-23 23:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479937, 192447, 368, '<td valign="top">what a cutie ... sure wish her dress wasnt blown out though ... and maybe if her pose wasnt so much bent over - but her expression is beautiful ... the sepia works well too</td>', 'what a cutie ... sure wish her dress wasnt blown out though ... and maybe if her pose wasnt so much bent over - but her expression is beautiful ... the sepia works well too', '2005-06-23 23:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479948, 191435, 37719, '<td valign="top">I looked and looked at this shot and tried real hard to put it into the challenge, but just couldn''t.  Did I miss something?</td>', 'I looked and looked at this shot and tried real hard to put it into the challenge, but just couldn''t.  Did I miss something?', '2005-06-23 23:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479950, 191059, 37719, '<td valign="top">At first look I wondered.  At second I noticed the stuffies or dolls.  I think the colors are great, but not sure about the rest of the crowd.  Hope you had fun shooting it, it looks it!  Nice shot!</td>', 'At first look I wondered.  At second I noticed the stuffies or dolls.  I think the colors are great, but not sure about the rest of the crowd.  Hope you had fun shooting it, it looks it!  Nice shot!', '2005-06-23 23:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479952, 190338, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo!  I liked it instantly!  The effect is perfectly executed. Nice job, well done!</td>', 'Very interesting photo!  I liked it instantly!  The effect is perfectly executed. Nice job, well done!', '2005-06-23 23:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479957, 192186, 37719, '<td valign="top">I hope Henkel has some friends.  Just caught my lighter side - even on the third pass.  Good shot!</td>', 'I hope Henkel has some friends.  Just caught my lighter side - even on the third pass.  Good shot!', '2005-06-23 23:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479958, 192448, 368, '<td valign="top">i like the abstract ... and going with your title ... i too have to ask .. what is it?</td>', 'i like the abstract ... and going with your title ... i too have to ask .. what is it?', '2005-06-23 23:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479961, 192186, 368, '<td valign="top">i like the depth of field .. i just wish the photo was taken with a solid background .. the checkboard is a bit distracting</td>', 'i like the depth of field .. i just wish the photo was taken with a solid background .. the checkboard is a bit distracting', '2005-06-23 23:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479964, 190603, 37719, '<td valign="top">I tried real hard to see this in a different way.  Of course it is a fantasay, I just thought it was not up to the challenge.</td>', 'I tried real hard to see this in a different way.  Of course it is a fantasay, I just thought it was not up to the challenge.', '2005-06-23 23:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479965, 191527, 368, '<td valign="top">i like the idea ... maybe you can catch a sunset in there too</td>', 'i like the idea ... maybe you can catch a sunset in there too', '2005-06-23 23:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479968, 191033, 37719, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate the shot and the mechanics behind it.  I just didn''t like it.  Not sure why.  I think if you had left the second hand out of the shot it would have been better.</td>', 'I can appreciate the shot and the mechanics behind it.  I just didn''t like it.  Not sure why.  I think if you had left the second hand out of the shot it would have been better.', '2005-06-23 23:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479970, 190953, 37719, '<td valign="top">I can really appreciate and do enjoy a good macro shot.  But I fail to see how this is relative to the challenge.</td>', 'I can really appreciate and do enjoy a good macro shot.  But I fail to see how this is relative to the challenge.', '2005-06-23 23:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479974, 192089, 37719, '<td valign="top">I just didn''t see ''Dreams''...I saw poor photo.  Very hard to look at.</td>', 'I just didn''t see ''Dreams''...I saw poor photo.  Very hard to look at.', '2005-06-23 23:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479980, 192446, 37719, '<td valign="top">What is above the clouds?  The moon?  Is that the fantasy?  I don''t get it.  What am I missing?</td>', 'What is above the clouds?  The moon?  Is that the fantasy?  I don''t get it.  What am I missing?', '2005-06-23 23:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479984, 191101, 37719, '<td valign="top">I think this is a nice shot.  I might crop it closer.  But I fail to see the Fantasy in it.</td>', 'I think this is a nice shot.  I might crop it closer.  But I fail to see the Fantasy in it.', '2005-06-23 23:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479988, 192481, 37719, '<td valign="top">I liked the processing.  Wish you had left the border off.  It just killed the shot for me.  The title could have been better too.  But the border was just too hard for me.</td>', 'I liked the processing.  Wish you had left the border off.  It just killed the shot for me.  The title could have been better too.  But the border was just too hard for me.', '2005-06-23 23:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1479990, 192477, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  I like it.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  I like it.  Good luck!', '2005-06-23 23:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1480001, 192410, 38648, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Great contrast  control<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-25 21:15:04.</i></td>', 'Very nice shot.  Great contrast  control', '2005-06-23 23:48:48.000000', '2005-08-25 22:15:04.000000', 1),
(1480004, 192209, 38648, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  IR is too cool</td>', 'I love this shot.  IR is too cool', '2005-06-23 23:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1480007, 190850, 38648, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2005-06-23 23:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1480074, 192361, 7485, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo, but just a little too much sharpening, it produces a distracting glow around the outline of the mountain. Landmannalaugar?</td>', 'Stunning photo, but just a little too much sharpening, it produces a distracting glow around the outline of the mountain. Landmannalaugar?', '2005-06-24 00:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1480084, 190016, 7485, '<td valign="top">Excellent light and composition, but horrible compression artifacts. You realize your file is just over 26KB? It could have been almost 6 times bigger, which would easily have gotten rid of those artifacts.</td>', 'Excellent light and composition, but horrible compression artifacts. You realize your file is just over 26KB? It could have been almost 6 times bigger, which would easily have gotten rid of those artifacts.', '2005-06-24 00:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1480086, 191369, 7485, '<td valign="top">Scary and brilliant - 9</td>', 'Scary and brilliant - 9', '2005-06-24 00:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1480094, 192365, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very cute, but I wonder if a much closer zoom would have been better, so that her expression, the statue and the book filled most of the frame.</td>', 'Very cute, but I wonder if a much closer zoom would have been better, so that her expression, the statue and the book filled most of the frame.', '2005-06-24 00:41:12.000000', NULL, 1);
