(1480102, 191448, 34759, '<td valign="top">I love this. It''s a beautiful and original shot that fits the challenge wonderfully. One of my favorites for this challenge.</td>', 'I love this. It''s a beautiful and original shot that fits the challenge wonderfully. One of my favorites for this challenge.', '2005-06-24 00:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
