(1481824, 192205, 35161, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image, the only thing maybe, I''d like to see a bit space more at the bottom...showing her right leg entirely...Great capture in any case! :)</td>', 'This is a very nice image, the only thing maybe, I''d like to see a bit space more at the bottom...showing her right leg entirely...Great capture in any case! :)', '2005-06-24 18:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
