(1482077, 192143, 25890, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this image. And I agree on the use of grain for mood. On the other hand, even though the rule of thirds is applied correctly, the negative space is a lot larger than needed in my opinion, and combined with the totally blown out part on the right hand side it only serves as an escape route for the viewer''s eyes.</td>', 'I like the concept of this image. And I agree on the use of grain for mood. On the other hand, even though the rule of thirds is applied correctly, the negative space is a lot larger than needed in my opinion, and combined with the totally blown out part on the right hand side it only serves as an escape route for the viewer''s eyes.', '2005-06-24 21:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482095, 190958, 554, '<td valign="top">nice shot.....8... but without the title I see no relation to the challenge. Still, it''s an 8 to me.<br/>btw, freedom comes with a change of attitude.  think about it.<br/></td>', 'nice shot.....8... but without the title I see no relation to the challenge. Still, it''s an 8 to me.btw, freedom comes with a change of attitude.  think about it.', '2005-06-24 21:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482121, 189944, 5792, '<td valign="top">Curious metal abstract. Image quality and clarity is decent. Composition is OK.<br/> <br/>This will leave some viewers with unanswered questions. The main thing will be they will wonder what that other part, besides the sky, that is reflected in the "space vehicle". Because it is to hard to figure out they may be a little frustrated and vote this composition a little lower as a result.</td>', 'Curious metal abstract. Image quality and clarity is decent. Composition is OK. This will leave some viewers with unanswered questions. The main thing will be they will wonder what that other part, besides the sky, that is reflected in the "space vehicle". Because it is to hard to figure out they may be a little frustrated and vote this composition a little lower as a result.', '2005-06-24 22:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482171, 192053, 25890, '<td valign="top">Composition is a little agressive. That is; instead of drawing to itself, if advances towards the viewer. Not that it''s a bad thing. It''s just a matter of personal preference/taste. Additionally, the picture is overexposed, therefore the water loses all its texture and instead of appearing to be a silky smooth flow, it turns into a blown out, white blob. I''d try to shoot this scene when the light is diffused and even, e.g. on an overcast day, or when the sun is low enough to provide front lighting (Assuming that the waterfall faces either east or west, and there''s nothing around that would block the light).</td>', 'Composition is a little agressive. That is; instead of drawing to itself, if advances towards the viewer. Not that it''s a bad thing. It''s just a matter of personal preference/taste. Additionally, the picture is overexposed, therefore the water loses all its texture and instead of appearing to be a silky smooth flow, it turns into a blown out, white blob. I''d try to shoot this scene when the light is diffused and even, e.g. on an overcast day, or when the sun is low enough to provide front lighting (Assuming that the waterfall faces either east or west, and there''s nothing around that would block the light).', '2005-06-24 22:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482192, 191370, 38838, '<td valign="top">After you are given your blue ribbon, I look forward to reading your comments about this photo. Awesome shot!</td>', 'After you are given your blue ribbon, I look forward to reading your comments about this photo. Awesome shot!', '2005-06-24 22:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
