(1482446, 192460, 19982, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments.  This was my only 10.  I loved the soft colors and textures in the scene with the starkness in the models black attire.  Overall lighting is great (even though I suspect a little D&amp;B which is adding to the effect).  Her pose is awesome and really transmits a feeling of freedom.  And how did she get so high off the ground?  Excellent photo.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Returning for comments.  This was my only 10.  I loved the soft colors and textures in the scene with the starkness in the models black attire.  Overall lighting is great (even though I suspect a little D&B which is adding to the effect).  Her pose is awesome and really transmits a feeling of freedom.  And how did she get so high off the ground?  Excellent photo.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-25 01:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1482454, 191327, 19982, '<td valign="top">I only had one 9 in this challenge.  This photo intrigues me so much!  My *only* fault with it was that I didn''t "connect" with the fantasy aspect as much as I would have liked.  But other than that, this photo is awesome and one that I would gladly hang on the wall!</td>', 'I only had one 9 in this challenge.  This photo intrigues me so much!  My *only* fault with it was that I didn''t "connect" with the fantasy aspect as much as I would have liked.  But other than that, this photo is awesome and one that I would gladly hang on the wall!', '2005-06-25 01:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
