(1483602, 191380, 19311, '<td valign="top">Cool shot but this is right here in our world, not beyond it</td>', 'Cool shot but this is right here in our world, not beyond it', '2005-06-25 22:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1483605, 192388, 19311, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool shot although I don''t know how well it will be recieved for this particular challenge.</td>', 'This is a very cool shot although I don''t know how well it will be recieved for this particular challenge.', '2005-06-25 22:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1483611, 190850, 19311, '<td valign="top">I can''t really tell how this was done but I like it!  Fits the challenge perfect and its extremely well executed.  I''ve been seeing a bunch of stuff that dosen''t fit well so this is a breath of fresh air.  10</td>', 'I can''t really tell how this was done but I like it!  Fits the challenge perfect and its extremely well executed.  I''ve been seeing a bunch of stuff that dosen''t fit well so this is a breath of fresh air.  10', '2005-06-25 22:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1483612, 190427, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good clean image. Colors are nice and the composition and framing very good.<br/>Image technical quality is high and focus good. It has low noise.<br/> <br/>A key to this image is how reviewers relate it to the challenge topic. Some will "get it" and others will not. How many do will determine if this image places high or in the middle of the pack.<br/> <br/>Only a minor technical suggestion. You might consider applying judicious dodge and burn for texturing and added visual interest.  This could be done for both building or sky. You could also consider selecting a color or two and post process them for greater color saturation.<br/> <br/>Overall this is a good picture.</td>', 'Good clean image. Colors are nice and the composition and framing very good.Image technical quality is high and focus good. It has low noise. A key to this image is how reviewers relate it to the challenge topic. Some will "get it" and others will not. How many do will determine if this image places high or in the middle of the pack. Only a minor technical suggestion. You might consider applying judicious dodge and burn for texturing and added visual interest.  This could be done for both building or sky. You could also consider selecting a color or two and post process them for greater color saturation. Overall this is a good picture.', '2005-06-25 22:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1483613, 191403, 19311, '<td valign="top">Very dreamy, well done.</td>', 'Very dreamy, well done.', '2005-06-25 22:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1483619, 192265, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and good color. Framing is nice. Appears that horizon is level.<br/> <br/>A view from this perspective will probably work for most voters as meeting the challenge. For some, of course, it will not. It is a creative approach to the challenge.<br/> <br/>On the technical side focus seems on the soft side and detail gets lost.</td>', 'Great perspective and good color. Framing is nice. Appears that horizon is level. A view from this perspective will probably work for most voters as meeting the challenge. For some, of course, it will not. It is a creative approach to the challenge. On the technical side focus seems on the soft side and detail gets lost.', '2005-06-25 22:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
