(1483964, 189175, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well I finally figured out what it is &amp; how you did it.  Simple and clever.  Doesn''t really cause me to think "fantasy world", but it is a unique perspective on ours, and that''s near enough for me.  7</td>', 'Well I finally figured out what it is & how you did it.  Simple and clever.  Doesn''t really cause me to think "fantasy world", but it is a unique perspective on ours, and that''s near enough for me.  7', '2005-06-26 06:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1483968, 190722, 26849, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Great execution. 10.  A good example of an image where you could use NeatImage.</td>', 'Great idea. Great execution. 10.  A good example of an image where you could use NeatImage.', '2005-06-26 07:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1484021, 192385, 9089, '<td valign="top">Colours are beautiful in this picture, dreaminess is good with the blur/zoom whichever... Composition though is a problem, my eye just seems to float to the top right corner where all the yellow flowers bled together into the yello blob, which then is just... well... yellow.  I wish there was some focal point in the picture, if so it would bump this way up.  As it is, a 6</td>', 'Colours are beautiful in this picture, dreaminess is good with the blur/zoom whichever... Composition though is a problem, my eye just seems to float to the top right corner where all the yellow flowers bled together into the yello blob, which then is just... well... yellow.  I wish there was some focal point in the picture, if so it would bump this way up.  As it is, a 6', '2005-06-26 09:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1484022, 192445, 9089, '<td valign="top">I can remember myself in that world, flying my airplanes.  Lighting on the boy is good, but lighting on the toys almost ruins the picture, as it is way too bright in relation to the rest of the photo.  I would also just use the one wooden airplane, and maybe have him being flying it, instead of being on the ground.  The helicopter in front of his face detracts from the simplicity of the photo you are trying to achieve.  One of the keys is to take away anything from the photo that does not specifically add to it.  That would be the helicopter.  5</td>', 'I can remember myself in that world, flying my airplanes.  Lighting on the boy is good, but lighting on the toys almost ruins the picture, as it is way too bright in relation to the rest of the photo.  I would also just use the one wooden airplane, and maybe have him being flying it, instead of being on the ground.  The helicopter in front of his face detracts from the simplicity of the photo you are trying to achieve.  One of the keys is to take away anything from the photo that does not specifically add to it.  That would be the helicopter.  5', '2005-06-26 09:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1484024, 192457, 9089, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out what the title means... Guess I won''t be able to.  Photo wise, the work that went into this is evident.  Although the foil on his? left arm coule be done a little better, or a slightly different pose so that it wouldn''t blend in with his body.  The photo is also tilted a little clockwise, so could use a little ccw rotation.  5</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out what the title means... Guess I won''t be able to.  Photo wise, the work that went into this is evident.  Although the foil on his? left arm coule be done a little better, or a slightly different pose so that it wouldn''t blend in with his body.  The photo is also tilted a little clockwise, so could use a little ccw rotation.  5', '2005-06-26 09:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1484026, 192329, 9089, '<td valign="top">Dragon''s definitely fantasy, I''m guessing an incense burner.  The smoke does add a touch of realism, but hard to get past the figurine-y (don''t think that''s a word, but I hope you understand)  feel of the picture.  I think you have done as much as you could with this subject.  5</td>', 'Dragon''s definitely fantasy, I''m guessing an incense burner.  The smoke does add a touch of realism, but hard to get past the figurine-y (don''t think that''s a word, but I hope you understand)  feel of the picture.  I think you have done as much as you could with this subject.  5', '2005-06-26 09:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1484029, 191532, 9089, '<td valign="top">I''ve thought about this, and if it did, it would still be a matter of how long it would take to grow it, then the rent of the guards to protect it, then the cost of fertilizers, etc....  Most bushes don''t grow this big in a year, but let us just imagine that they do... I see in your photo... oh... about $25 now if it took a year to grow that $25, why just think, in only 320 years or so, you''d have enough for that big Canon EOS 1DS-Mark II... :-)  Seriously though great idea, good implementation.  A little better lighting to really set off the money, instead of the dark hole in the middle of the picture that sort of swallows the idea would really help.  5</td>', 'I''ve thought about this, and if it did, it would still be a matter of how long it would take to grow it, then the rent of the guards to protect it, then the cost of fertilizers, etc....  Most bushes don''t grow this big in a year, but let us just imagine that they do... I see in your photo... oh... about $25 now if it took a year to grow that $25, why just think, in only 320 years or so, you''d have enough for that big Canon EOS 1DS-Mark II... :-)  Seriously though great idea, good implementation.  A little better lighting to really set off the money, instead of the dark hole in the middle of the picture that sort of swallows the idea would really help.  5', '2005-06-26 09:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1484053, 189945, 32997, '<td valign="top">Love the specks of light in the eyes..great mystery here created with the levels..good take on the challenge.</td>', 'Love the specks of light in the eyes..great mystery here created with the levels..good take on the challenge.', '2005-06-26 10:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1484054, 192461, 32997, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...the background is wonderful...compostition both interesting and creative. Excellent shot!</td>', 'Beautiful...the background is wonderful...compostition both interesting and creative. Excellent shot!', '2005-06-26 10:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1484057, 192189, 32997, '<td valign="top">Depth of focus and tones are beautiful..great shot.</td>', 'Depth of focus and tones are beautiful..great shot.', '2005-06-26 10:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1484089, 192467, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W. Sprouts make a curious surrealistic world that works well for this challenge. Exposure is good. Full range of tones.<br/> <br/>The white objects in a line are mostly out of focus draw but strongly draw attention. What they are and their purpose is unknown and are major distractions. It could be legitimately argued that in a fantasy world you won;t understand all things, but viewers will not buy that with those objects and it will hurt the overal score of this image. There is background some noise that should be removed.</td>', 'Nice B&W. Sprouts make a curious surrealistic world that works well for this challenge. Exposure is good. Full range of tones. The white objects in a line are mostly out of focus draw but strongly draw attention. What they are and their purpose is unknown and are major distractions. It could be legitimately argued that in a fantasy world you won;t understand all things, but viewers will not buy that with those objects and it will hurt the overal score of this image. There is background some noise that should be removed.', '2005-06-26 10:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1484093, 190988, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good colors and good general image technical quality. It does not have overexposed areas, applies good the rule of thirds well with the modern structure and the dramatic clouds add interest to the composition.<br/> <br/>You might consider using light dodging to slightly brighten the far left side of the frame on the darkened portion of the building to keep it from drawing attention away ffrom the rest of the image.<br/> <br/>Good image. Should get a decent score.</td>', 'Nice composition, good colors and good general image technical quality. It does not have overexposed areas, applies good the rule of thirds well with the modern structure and the dramatic clouds add interest to the composition. You might consider using light dodging to slightly brighten the far left side of the frame on the darkened portion of the building to keep it from drawing attention away ffrom the rest of the image. Good image. Should get a decent score.', '2005-06-26 11:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1484106, 192466, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good idea for a fantasy world. A garden scene works and the idea of fairy and child is good. Composition and framing generally OK.<br/> <br/>There are some areas where this could be improved. The general image technical quality is not particularly high and focus is soft. It appears the contrast is not correct and that a black point should be set. The direct sunlight is harsh, particualrly on the left side of the fairy character.<br/> <br/>You might have considered having the fairy hold the broad leaf on the long stem over the child to convey a sense that the child is undergoing an enchanted spell. It might be good to have her attention directed toward the fairy character. In this pose she appears disinterested.</td>', 'Good idea for a fantasy world. A garden scene works and the idea of fairy and child is good. Composition and framing generally OK. There are some areas where this could be improved. The general image technical quality is not particularly high and focus is soft. It appears the contrast is not correct and that a black point should be set. The direct sunlight is harsh, particualrly on the left side of the fairy character. You might have considered having the fairy hold the broad leaf on the long stem over the child to convey a sense that the child is undergoing an enchanted spell. It might be good to have her attention directed toward the fairy character. In this pose she appears disinterested.', '2005-06-26 11:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1484108, 190484, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, composition and colors work well. Good solid background that balance well against the birght colors. Reviewer will likely feel this meets the challenge. Very appealing image that should score well.</td>', 'Nice concept, composition and colors work well. Good solid background that balance well against the birght colors. Reviewer will likely feel this meets the challenge. Very appealing image that should score well.', '2005-06-26 11:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1484119, 191033, 5792, '<td valign="top">Unique idea put together well in the photograph. Gives the viewer plenty to relate to and think about even if they are not into rock and rol music. Composed well.<br/> <br/>The area around the bealtline of the guitarist is slightly overexposed and should be darken just a little bit.<br/> <br/>Nice idea that should be favored by reviewers.</td>', 'Unique idea put together well in the photograph. Gives the viewer plenty to relate to and think about even if they are not into rock and rol music. Composed well. The area around the bealtline of the guitarist is slightly overexposed and should be darken just a little bit. Nice idea that should be favored by reviewers.', '2005-06-26 11:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1484125, 192386, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and the deep purple and greens that are not overdone works well. <br/> <br/>The background should have noise reduction applied to it and there are a number of hots spots reflected in the bubbles that are distracting. You might consider cloning out the tiny bubbles on the right that have no real definition and do not add much to the composition.</td>', 'Interesting concept and the deep purple and greens that are not overdone works well.  The background should have noise reduction applied to it and there are a number of hots spots reflected in the bubbles that are distracting. You might consider cloning out the tiny bubbles on the right that have no real definition and do not add much to the composition.', '2005-06-26 11:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
