(1484941, 190016, 5792, '<td valign="top">Night cityscapes with a water foreground are always a nice idea. The bright area above the highest building is a cool idea. Good assortment of colors.<br/> <br/>Hard to say if voters will feel this meets the challenge all that well or not.<br/> <br/>Technically you might have considered zooming in on the buildings more to reduce the amount of sky that adds little to the composition and have the buidings much larger and with better definition.  Conditions did not allow it but if the water would have been smoother to have a better reflection of the city it would have had added interest for viewers.</td>', 'Night cityscapes with a water foreground are always a nice idea. The bright area above the highest building is a cool idea. Good assortment of colors. Hard to say if voters will feel this meets the challenge all that well or not. Technically you might have considered zooming in on the buildings more to reduce the amount of sky that adds little to the composition and have the buidings much larger and with better definition.  Conditions did not allow it but if the water would have been smoother to have a better reflection of the city it would have had added interest for viewers.', '2005-06-26 23:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
