(1484958, 191369, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting fantasy concept. Can''t tell if Sadie is good or evil but she is definitely different. Colors are bright and contrast excellent. The zoom focus tecnique seems to work pretty well. Your subject is nicely highlighted n the centere of the frame.<br/> <br/>Generally speaking DPC voters like natural color more than surreal ones even in a challenge of this nature. That make hurt this image in voting.<br/> <br/>The nature of this image makes it difficult to assess from a technical standpoint.</td>', 'Interesting fantasy concept. Can''t tell if Sadie is good or evil but she is definitely different. Colors are bright and contrast excellent. The zoom focus tecnique seems to work pretty well. Your subject is nicely highlighted n the centere of the frame. Generally speaking DPC voters like natural color more than surreal ones even in a challenge of this nature. That make hurt this image in voting. The nature of this image makes it difficult to assess from a technical standpoint.', '2005-06-26 23:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
