(1494726, 189175, 36078, '<td valign="top">From the Critique Club<br/> <br/>Think this photo is a very balanced piece.  With the main subjects(the water drops) very low in the photo against the blurred background it makes it easy on the viewers eyes.  <br/> <br/>The one negative thing about the photograph is their is only one main color.  I think it still works well but maybe have hurt the photo in the long run.<br/> <br/>Still a nicely composed photo.</td>', 'From the Critique Club Think this photo is a very balanced piece.  With the main subjects(the water drops) very low in the photo against the blurred background it makes it easy on the viewers eyes.   The one negative thing about the photograph is their is only one main color.  I think it still works well but maybe have hurt the photo in the long run. Still a nicely composed photo.', '2005-06-30 10:45:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1494740, 190016, 36078, '<td valign="top">From the Critique Club<br/> <br/>I have been to Hong Kong (1990-1991), and the photo does remind me of a fantasy type of city.  I just think a orverall lack of detail in the city hurt the photo in the challenge.<br/> <br/>Things are so distant no one can truly appreciate your "city of the future".  The highlight and lighting above the main building does look very nice.<br/> <br/></td>', 'From the Critique Club I have been to Hong Kong (1990-1991), and the photo does remind me of a fantasy type of city.  I just think a orverall lack of detail in the city hurt the photo in the challenge. Things are so distant no one can truly appreciate your "city of the future".  The highlight and lighting above the main building does look very nice. ', '2005-06-30 10:51:54.000000', NULL, 0),
