(1498707, 190722, 36006, '<td valign="top">NIce job anyway.<br/> <br/>Great Stuff.<br/> <br/>The only thing is, I know this is a fantasy, but what she is lying on doesn''t sell me.<br/> <br/>Other than that........fricken nice job!</td>', 'NIce job anyway. Great Stuff. The only thing is, I know this is a fantasy, but what she is lying on doesn''t sell me. Other than that........fricken nice job!', '2005-07-02 00:35:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1499151, 191162, 39165, '<td valign="top">&lt;nerdalert&gt;<br/>I really really like this shot, and even when you know it''s a cutout - it''s hard to tell.. I''m still not convinced you didn''t actually have Sir McKellen in your back yard.<br/>If I had to say something negative (which I probably don''t, but will anyway), it''s that the leaves don''t look very middle-earthy.. If you know what I mean. Maybe it would have helped to tone down the green a bit - they look too "crisp" to fit in where Gandalf would travel. :)<br/>Still, though - thumbs up. :)<br/>&lt;/nerdalert&gt;</td>', '<nerdalert>I really really like this shot, and even when you know it''s a cutout - it''s hard to tell.. I''m still not convinced you didn''t actually have Sir McKellen in your back yard.If I had to say something negative (which I probably don''t, but will anyway), it''s that the leaves don''t look very middle-earthy.. If you know what I mean. Maybe it would have helped to tone down the green a bit - they look too "crisp" to fit in where Gandalf would travel. :)Still, though - thumbs up. :)</nerdalert>', '2005-07-02 04:34:01.000000', NULL, 0),
