(1572488, 191527, 38267, '<td valign="top">Another really cool picture.  It really looks surreal...almost like when people photoshop different images into 1 image.  I can tell you have a good eye for photography as many people would never even have noticed the cool reflection off the camera lens.<br/> <br/>Nice!<br/> <br/>Dave</td>', 'Another really cool picture.  It really looks surreal...almost like when people photoshop different images into 1 image.  I can tell you have a good eye for photography as many people would never even have noticed the cool reflection off the camera lens. Nice! Dave', '2005-07-29 19:11:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1585546, 191162, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''ve not read or watched LOTR so I''m not familiar with the characters, but it was fun reading through your comments to see who you "fooled" with this one :)    Wherever you''re doing these "deep forested fog" shots, you''re certainly conveying the mood quite well.  <br/> <br/>Maybe just a bit too much light on the front leaves, but that''s just my .02.</td>', 'I''ve not read or watched LOTR so I''m not familiar with the characters, but it was fun reading through your comments to see who you "fooled" with this one :)    Wherever you''re doing these "deep forested fog" shots, you''re certainly conveying the mood quite well.   Maybe just a bit too much light on the front leaves, but that''s just my .02.', '2005-08-03 23:56:04.000000', NULL, 0),
