(1623515, 192447, 18932, '<td valign="top">Would have rated this fifty billion out of ten. It looks almost like a fairy doll, gorgeous subject, simply a stunning photo, composition, sepia, depth of field, all make this photo, I love how she looks like she''s floating.</td>', 'Would have rated this fifty billion out of ten. It looks almost like a fairy doll, gorgeous subject, simply a stunning photo, composition, sepia, depth of field, all make this photo, I love how she looks like she''s floating.', '2005-08-19 10:05:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1625147, 192360, 18932, '<td valign="top">A very dreamy shot. The ever so slight blow-out in the fork of the tree clinches this shot, defines the dreaminess. If the tree stump were any sharper it may have damaged the illusion, but it''s great - the amount of detail to look at in this is great and despite this doesn''t seem cluttered at all.</td>', 'A very dreamy shot. The ever so slight blow-out in the fork of the tree clinches this shot, defines the dreaminess. If the tree stump were any sharper it may have damaged the illusion, but it''s great - the amount of detail to look at in this is great and despite this doesn''t seem cluttered at all.', '2005-08-19 23:28:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1625362, 192447, 14986, '<td valign="top">Awww...how cute!  I wish the dress wasn''t quite so blown out.  I also would have maybe tried some sort of glowy filter on this to give it more of a fantasy look for the challenge...but for simply a keeper portrait, I love it as it is.  Darling photo.</td>', 'Awww...how cute!  I wish the dress wasn''t quite so blown out.  I also would have maybe tried some sort of glowy filter on this to give it more of a fantasy look for the challenge...but for simply a keeper portrait, I love it as it is.  Darling photo.', '2005-08-20 00:52:24.000000', NULL, 0),
