(1645362, 192457, 37719, '<td valign="top">I wish I had commented on this during the challenge.  I gave it a 10 and think it deserved higher, but unfortunately that is not possible.  Very nice image and well done.  Nicely composed and very good control of the lighting/reflections.  Also very creative.  Again, well done, nice job!</td>', 'I wish I had commented on this during the challenge.  I gave it a 10 and think it deserved higher, but unfortunately that is not possible.  Very nice image and well done.  Nicely composed and very good control of the lighting/reflections.  Also very creative.  Again, well done, nice job!', '2005-08-25 19:21:10.000000', NULL, 0),
